<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">2 Sameela Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Sameela Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Same</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Sameela</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Sameela Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Nam7antho Sameela Maxaafay, koyro Sameela Maxaafa kaallees. Ha maxaafay, Dawiti koyro dugeha baggan de7iya Yihuda kawo gididi (shem 1-4), qassi guuthu gam7idi, pudeha baggan de7iya Isra7eele gujidi kumetha biitta kawo gididi haarida taariketa odees (shem 5-24). Dawiti ba kawotetha dalgisanawunne ba maata minthanaw sooranne karera de7iya morketara oletida olaa loythidi qoncisees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dawiti xoossa keethi keexanaw koyis, shin hessa oothana mela Xoossi dosibeenna woyko koybeenna (7:1-3).</para>
  <para style="ip">Xoossi Dawitara caaqidaba gidikoka, I, Ooriyo mache Bersaabira laymatida wode iya kawotethaynne iya soo asay meto bolla wodhidosona (shem 13-18; 20-21). Hessa gaason, iya soo asa giddon iitabay medhetis; iya naytape daroti hayqidosona.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dawiti oothida gita oosotape guuthati, Isra7eele kawotetha hara kawotethati qohonna mela naagis (1 Same 31); tammanne nam7u Isra7eele kochati issife daana mela oothis; kawotetha aqo woga wothis (2 Same 8:15-18). Dawiti ba duussan nagari woyko borey bayna asi gidenna, shin issi tuma Xoossafe attishin hara xoossi goyinnibeenna. Yihuda kawotethay eqidi de7ida wode ubban, Xoossay Dawitas caaqida caaquwa naagis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Dawiti Saa7olas yeehuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 1:1-27">1:1-27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawiti Yihuda bolla kawotuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 2:1-4:12">2:1—4:12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawiti Isra7eele ubbaa bolla kawotuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-6:23">5:1—6:23</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossay Dawitas caaqida caaquwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-29">7:1-29</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawiti oletida ola <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-10:19">8:1—10:19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawitanne Bersaabo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 11:1-12:31">11:1—12:31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawita son medhetida geellatetha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 13:1-14:33">13:1—14:33</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Abeseloome geellatethanne hara hanotata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 15:1-21:22">15:1—21:22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nam7u Dawita mazmureta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-23:7">22:1—23:7</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawita toora moconata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">23:8-39</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dawiti Isra7eele asaa taybuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">24:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Saa7ola Hayquwa Si7is</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1"/>Saa7oli hayqidaape guye, Dawiti Amaaleqata xooni simmidi Xiqilaagan nam7u gallas gam7is. <verse eid="2SA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2"/>Heedzantho gallas issi addey ba ma7uwa daakidi, ba huuphen baana qolidi, Saa7oli dunkaanida gutaape yis. I Dawitako yidi sa7an gufannidi ziggis. <verse eid="2SA 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3"/>Dawiti, “Neeni awape yadii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">I zaaridi, “Taani Isra7eeleti dunkaanida gutaape kessa ekada yas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4"/>Dawiti, “Ane hanidaba taw oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">I zaaridi, “Nu olanchoti olape baqatidosona; nu asaape daroti hayqidosona; Saa7olinne iya na7ay Yoonataani hayqidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5"/>Dawiti iyaw odida panthaa, “Saa7olinne iya na7aa Yoonataani hayqidaysa neeni aybin eray?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6"/>Panthay, “Taani Gilbo7a deriya bolla de7ishin, Saa7oli ba toora guufetidi eqidaysa be7as; para gaaretinne para asati Saa7olako matatidosona. <verse eid="2SA 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7"/>He wode Saa7oli guye simmidi tana demmidi xeegis. Taani, ‘Yee’ yaagada koyas. <verse eid="2SA 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8"/>Saa7oli, ‘Neeni oonee?’ yaagidi oychin, ‘Taani Amaaleqa asi’ yaagada zaaras. <verse eid="2SA 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9"/>Hessafe guye, Saa7oli, ‘Taani madunxada, hayqos gakas; neeni ta bolla keyiya eqada tana wodha’ yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10"/>I kundidaape guye hayqope attonnaysa erida gisho taani iya bolla keya eqada iya wodhas. Iya huuphen de7iya kallachanne iya qesen de7iya ambaariya ekada neeko ta godaako yas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11"/>Dawitinne Dawita asay kayotidi, banta ma7uwa daakidosona. <verse eid="2SA 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12"/>Enti Saa7oli, Yoonataani, Godaa olanchotinne Isra7eele asay olan wurida gisho omarsi gakanaw kayotidosona; yeekidosona; xoomidosona.<verse eid="2SA 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13"/>Dawiti hessa entaw ehida panthaa, “Ne awupe yadii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">I zaaridi, “Taani bete asi gididi de7iya Amaaleqa addiya na7a” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14"/>Dawiti, “Goday tiyida kawa wodhanaw ne kushiya denthashe waanada yayyabikii?” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15"/>Dawiti ba asatape issuwa xeegidi, “Iya wodha” yaagin, I Amaaleqa panthaa caddidi wodhis. <verse eid="2SA 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16"/>Dawiti Amaaleqa addiyako, “Goday tiyida kawa taani wodhas” yaagada “Neeni ne doonan markatida gisho ne suuthaa gomey nena oyko” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Saa7olasinne Yoonatanas Yeekis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17"/>Dawiti Saa7olasinne iya na7aa Yoonatanas haysada yaagidi zeleelis. <verse eid="2SA 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18"/>Yihuda asay, “Donge yeeho” geetetiya ha zelelsa tamaarana mela kiittis; ha zelelsay Yaashara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yaashara: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xillota maxaafaa guussu </char></note> maxaafan xaafetis.<verse eid="2SA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19"/>“Neno Isra7eele, ne halaqati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">dhoqa bessan hayqidosona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:19">Wolqaamati waanidi kundidona!<verse eid="2SA 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20"/>Filisxeeme macca nayti hessa si7idi ufaytonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">qaxaretiboona asaa macca nayti hashshu goonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">haysa Gaate kataman odopite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:20">Asqaloona ogetan awaajofite.<verse eid="2SA 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21"/>Hinteno Gilbo7a dereto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">hinte bolla iri bukofo; aki wodhofo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">He bessan wolqaamata gondalley tunida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:21">Saa7ola gondalley zayten qushetiboona gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:21">he gadiyan kathi dolopo.<verse eid="2SA 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22"/>Goyretidaysata suuthaafe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">wolqaamata modhuwafe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:22">Yoonataana dongey guye gibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:22">Saa7ola mashshay kallonna simmibeenna.<verse eid="2SA 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23"/>Saa7olinne Yoonataani doseteyisata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">hayqoninne paxan shaaketibookona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:23">Enti arganthafe aadhidi eeso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:23">gaammofe aadhidi mino.<verse eid="2SA 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24"/>Hinteno Isra7eele maccasaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">zo7onne alleeqo ma7o mayzidaysas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:24">hinte ma7uwa worqan alleeqisida Saa7olas yeekite.<verse eid="2SA 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25"/>Wolqaamati olan waanidi kundidona?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:25">Yoonataani dhoqa bessan hayqis.<verse eid="2SA 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26"/>Ta ishaa Yoonataana, ta new azzanayis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">ne taw daro al7o.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 1:26">Neeni tana dosiya dosoy malaalsees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:26">macca siiqopeka aadhees.<verse eid="2SA 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27"/>Wolqaamati waanidi kundidona?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 1:27">Ola miisheyka waanidi dhayidee?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 1:27">yaagidi Dawiti zeleelis.<verse eid="2SA 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Yihuda Bolla Kawotis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti, “Yihuda katamatape issuwa boo?” yaagidi Godaa oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Goday, “Ee, ba” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Dawiti, “Awu boo” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Goday, “Kebroona ba” yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="2SA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2"/>Dawiti ba nam7u macheta, Izira7eele Aknahoomanne kase Naabala machiw Qarmeloosa Abigiya ekidi Kebroona katamaa bis. <verse eid="2SA 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3"/>Dawiti baara de7iya asatanne enta soo asa ubbaa ehin, Kebroonaninne iya heeran de7iya katamatan de7idosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4"/>Yihuda asati Kebroona katamaa yidi, Dawita tiyidi Yihuda bolla kawothidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Dawiti Yaabesa Galada asay Saa7ola moogidaysa si7ida wode, <verse eid="2SA 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5"/>I ase kiittidi, “Hinte hinte godaa Saa7ola moogida gisho he keehatethas Goday hintena anjo. <verse eid="2SA 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6"/>Goday siiquwanne tumatethaa hintew qonciso; taanika ha keehatetha gisho hintew lo77o kushe zaarana. <verse eid="2SA 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7"/>Hiza minnite; xaalite; hinte goday Saa7oli hayqis. Yihuda asay tana tiyidi, banta bolla kawothidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nam7u Keethata Giddon De7iya Ola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8"/>Saa7ola tora moconay Neera na7ay Abeneeri Saa7ola na7aa Iyabuste ekidi, Mahinayma geetetiya bessaa efis. <verse eid="2SA 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9"/>Iya Galadan, Aseeran, Izra7eelan, Efreeman, Biniyaameninne Isra7eele biitta ubban kawothis. <verse eid="2SA 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10"/>Saa7ola na7ay, Iyabustey Isra7eele bolla kawotiya wode iyaw oytamu laythi; I nam7u laythi kawotis. Gidoshin, Yihuda asay Dawita kaallidosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11"/>Dawiti Kebroonan Yihuda bolla laapun laythinne bagga kawotis.<verse eid="2SA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12"/>Neera na7ay Abeneerinne Saa7ola na7ay Iyabuste asay Mahinaymape Gaba7oona bidosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13"/>Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabinne Dawita asay Gaba7oona olla haatha matan entara gahetidosona. Issi cugay olla haathaafe hefinthan uttin, issi cugay hafinthan uttis. <verse eid="2SA 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14"/>Abeneeri Iyo7aabako, “Ane hintefenne nuupe panthati dendidi, nu sinthan oleto” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Iyo7aabi, “Ero, dendidi oleto” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15"/>Hessa gisho, Biniyaamepe Saa7ola na7aa Iyabustes tammanne nam7u asati keyidi, Dawitas eqida tammanne nam7u asatara ola gahetidosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16"/>Issoy issoy ba morkiya huuphiya oykidi, mashshan miyen caddis; hessada hannidi laatamanne oydday hayqidosona. Hessa gisho Gaba7oonan de7iya he bessay Mashsha biitta geetetis. <verse eid="2SA 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17"/>He gallas wolqaama ola oletidi, Dawita asay Abeneeranne Isra7eele asaa xoonis.<verse eid="2SA 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18"/>Xaruya nayti heedzay Iyo7aabi, Abisinne Asaheeli he bessan de7oosona; Asaheeli woshi7eda eeson woxidi, <verse eid="2SA 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19"/>Asaheeli Abeneera ushachi woyko haddirsi goonna yedethis. <verse eid="2SA 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20"/>Abeneeri guye simmidi, “Asaheela, nenee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Asaheeli, “Ee tana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21"/>Abeneeri, “Ushachi woyko haddirsi simmada, asatape issuwa oykada iya ola miishiya eka” yaagis. Shin Asaheeli iya yedetheysa aggonna ixis.<verse eid="2SA 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22"/>Qassika Abeneeri, “Taani nena sa7ara gathada oythonna de7ishin, tana yedetheysa agga! Nena wodhada taani ne ishaa Iyo7aaba som7uwa waatada xeellanee?” yaagidi waassis. <verse eid="2SA 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23"/>Shin Asaheeli iya yedetheysa aggonna ixis. Hessa gisho, Abeneeri toora guye yeddidi, Asaheela uluwa caddin tooray zokora kanthidi keyis. Asaheeli he bessan kundidi hayqis; Asaheeli hayqida bessaa gakida asa ubbay yan eqis.<verse eid="2SA 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24"/>Shin Iyo7aabinne Abisi Abeneera gooddidosona; awi wulliya wode Gaba7oona mela biittako efiya ogiyan Gaadape sintha baggara de7iya Ama zumako gakidosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25"/>Biniyaame asay Abeneerako shiiqidosona; issi cuga medhidi issi zumaa bolla eqidosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26"/>Abeneeri Iyo7aaba xeegidi, “Merinaw oletishe daaneyee? Haysa wursethay camo gidanaysa neeni erikii? Ne asay, banta ishata gooddeysa aggana mela ayis odikii?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27"/>Iyo7aabi, “De7o Xoossay ero! Neeni odonnaba gidiyako ta asay ba ishata sa7i wontana gakanaw goodda aggokona” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28"/>Iyo7aabi moyze punnin asa ubbay essis. Isra7eeleta zaari goodibookona woyko olibookona. <verse eid="2SA 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29"/>Abeneerinne iya asay he qamma kumethi hemetidi Araba gadha gakidosona. Yordaanose shaafa pinnidi, Betroona kanthidi Mahinayme yidosona.<verse eid="2SA 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30"/>Iyo7aabi Abeneera gooddeysa aggidi, ba asa ubbaa issi bessi shiishidi xeelliya wode, Asaheela gujonna Dawita asaape tammanne uddufun asi pacis. <verse eid="2SA 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31"/>Shin Dawita asay Abeneerara de7iya Biniyaame kochatape heedzu xeetanne usupun tammu asi wodhidosona. <verse eid="2SA 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32"/>Asaheela aha ekidi, Beeteleme kataman de7iya iya aawa duufon moogidosona. Iyo7aabinne iya asay qamma kumethi hemetidi sa7i wontiya wode Kebroona gakidosona.<verse eid="2SA 2:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1"/>Saa7ola soo asaynne Dawita asay daro wode oletidosona; Dawiti olan minni minni biya wode Saa7ola asay daaburi daaburi bis.<verse eid="2SA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2"/>Kebroonan Dawitas nayti yeletidosona; Izira7eele Aknahooma yelida bayra na7ay Amnoona; <verse eid="2SA 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3"/>Qarmeloosa Abigiya kase Naabala machiya yelida Kil7aabi nam7antho na7a. Gashura kawa Talmaya na7iya Ma7ika yelida Abeseloomey heedzantho na7a. <verse eid="2SA 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4"/>Oyddanthoy Haagita na7aa Adoona; ichashanthoy Abixaala na7aa Safaaxa. <verse eid="2SA 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5"/>Usupunthoy Dawita mache Egili na7aa Yitra7aama; ha nayti ubbay Kebroonan yeletidosona.<verse eid="2SA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abeneeri Dawitara Caaqis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6"/>Saa7ola soo asaaranne Dawita soo asaara oletiya wode Abeneeri Saa7ola asaa bolla minni minni bis. <verse eid="2SA 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7"/>Saa7olas Iyoheela na7a gidida Irxifo geetetiya issi laggethiya de7awusu; Iyabustey Abeneerako, “Ta aawa laggethera ayis aqadii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8"/>Abeneeri iya odan daro yilotidi, “Tana neeni Yihudako simmida gaata kana gadiyee? Taani ne aawa Saa7olas, iya ishatasinne iya dabbotas ammanetada de7as; nenaka Dawitas aathada immabike. Shin ha77i neeni tana ha maccase gisho mootaasa! <verse eid="2SA 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9"/>Xoossay Dawitas oothana gidi caaqida qaala taani polonna ixiko, Xoossi tana pirdo. <verse eid="2SA 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10"/>Saa7ola kochaafe kawotethaa wosisidi, Daanepe Barsaabe gakanaw Isra7eele bollanne Yihuda bolla, Dawita araata minthanaw Goday caaqis” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11"/>Iyabustey Abeneeras yayyida gisho hara qaala pogibeenna.<verse eid="2SA 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12"/>Abeneeri Dawitako, “Biittay oossee? Neeni taara caaqa; Isra7eele asa ubbay neeko simmana mela ta nena maaddana” yaagidi ase kiittis.<verse eid="2SA 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13"/>Dawiti, “Lo77o! Ta neera caaqana. Shin taani nena issiba oychayis; neeni tana be7anaw yaa wode Saa7ola na7iw Melkoolo ekonna yoopa” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti Saa7ola na7a Iyabusteko, “Xeetu Filisxeemeta qaaratada koyta oothada immida ta machiw Melkoolo taw imma” yaagidi ase kiittis. <verse eid="2SA 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15"/>Iyabustey ase kiittidi I azina Lawusha na7a Palxi7eelape kessi ekis. <verse eid="2SA 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16"/>I azinay Biraqima katama gakanaw yeekishe I geedo kaallis. Abeneeri iyako, “Guye soo ba” yaagin addey guye simmidi bis.<verse eid="2SA 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17"/>Abeneeri Isra7eele cimatako bidi, “Dawiti hinte bolla kawotana mela daro wode amotideta. <verse eid="2SA 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18"/>Ha77i polite! Goday, ‘Ta asaa Isra7eele, Filisxeemeta kushepenne enta morketa ubbaa kushepe ta aylliya Dawita baggara ashshana’ gidaysa hassayite” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19"/>Abeneeri Biniyaame kochatas hessa odis. Isra7eele asaynne Biniyaame asa ubbay oothanaw koyida ubbaa Dawitas odanaw Abeneeri Kebroona bis.<verse eid="2SA 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20"/>Abeneeri baara laatamu asi ekidi, Kebroona bin, Dawiti iyawunne iya asaas gibira giigisis. <verse eid="2SA 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21"/>Abeneeri Dawitako, “Enti neera caaqana melanne ne wozanay amotiya ubbaa ne haarana mela ta bada Isra7eele asaa kawas ta godaas shiishana” yaagis. Yaagin Dawiti Abeneera moyzidi saro yeddis.<verse eid="2SA 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyo7aabi Abeneera Wodhis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22"/>He wode Dawita asaynne Iyo7aabi olape darobaa di77idi simmidosona. Shin Dawiti iya saro ba gidi yeddida gisho, Abeneeri Kebroonan Dawitara deenna. <verse eid="2SA 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23"/>Iyo7aabinne iyara de7iya olanchoti gakiya wode asay, “Neera na7aa Abeneeri kawa Dawitako yin, kawoy iya yeddin saro bis” yaagidi odidosona.<verse eid="2SA 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24"/>Hessa gisho, Iyo7aabi kawako bidi, “Hessi waanidi hanidee? Abeneeri neeko yin, ayis yeddadii? Heko I bikichis! <verse eid="2SA 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25"/>Neera na7ay Abeneeri nena cimmanaw, neeni geliyasonne keyaso be7anawunne neeni oothiya ubbaa eranaw yis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26"/>Iyo7aabi Dawita sinthafe keyidi, Abeneera geedo kiitaa yeddin, enti iya Siira olla haatha matape guye zaaridosona; shin Dawiti hessa erenna. <verse eid="2SA 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27"/>Abeneeri Kebroona simmidi yida wode Iyo7aabi iyara dumma odetanaw koyida daanisidi dirsa pengiyako de7iya kifiliyanne iya efis. Ba ishaa Asaheela suutha zaaranaw Abeneera ulon caddin Abeneeri he bessan hayqis.<verse eid="2SA 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28"/>Dawiti guyepe hessa si7ida wode, “Taaninne ta kawotethay Neera na7aa Abeneera suuthaa gisho Godaa sinthan merinaw oyshetoko. <verse eid="2SA 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29"/>Iya suuthay Iyo7aabanne iya aawa soo asa acho; madunthi de7iya asi woyko goga hargey de7iya asi woyko wobbe asi woyko mashshan hayqiya asi woyko koshatiya asi Iyo7aaba kochan dhayopo” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30"/>Gaba7oonan keyida olan banta ishaa Asaheela Abeneeri wodhida gisho, Iyo7aabinne iya isha Abisi Abeneera wodhidosona.<verse eid="2SA 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31"/>Dawiti Iyo7aabanne iyara de7iya asaa, “Hinte ma7uwa daakite; baana qolite; Abeneera halaa sinthan yeekite” yaagis. Kawo Dawiti hala kaallidi duufo bis. <verse eid="2SA 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32"/>Abeneeri Kebroonan moogetis; kawoy ba qaala dhoqu oothidi duufon yeekis; asa ubbay yeekidosona. <verse eid="2SA 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33"/>Kawoy Abeneeras,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:33">“Abeneeri eeya asada hayqanaw bessii?<verse eid="2SA 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34"/>Ne kushey qashetibeenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 3:34">Ne tohoy santhalaatan oyketibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 3:34">Asi iita asa kushen hayqeysada hayqis”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">yaagidi zeleelis. Asa ubbay Abeneeras zaaridi yeekidosona.<verse eid="2SA 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35"/>He gallas Dawiti kathi maana mela asay iya shoobbidosona. Shin Dawiti, “Awa ayfey de7ishin, kathi woyko haraba baariko Xoossi tana pirdo” yaagidi caaqis. <verse eid="2SA 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36"/>Kawoy oothidaba asa ubbay be7idi ufaytidosona; tumaka kawoy oothidaba ubbay asaa ufaysis. <verse eid="2SA 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37"/>Hessa gisho, he gallas Dawita asaynne Isra7eele asa ubbay kawoy Neera na7aa Abeneera wodhisiboonaysa eridosona.<verse eid="2SA 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38"/>Kawoy ba aylletako, “Isra7eele biittan gita asinne halaqi hayqidaysa hinte akeekeketii? <verse eid="2SA 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39"/>Taani Xoossay tiyida kawo gidikoka, taani daaburancho; haysati Xaruya nayti ta bolla minnidosona; iita oothidaysatas Goday enta oosuwada zaaro” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 3:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyabuste Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1"/>Saa7ola na7ay Iyabustey Abeneeri Kebroonan hayqidaysa si7ida wode iya wozanay til7is; Isra7eele asa ubbayka dagammis. <verse eid="2SA 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2"/>Saa7ola na7aa Iyabustes ola kaalethiya nam7u halaqati de7oosona; issuwa sunthay Ba7ana; hankoy qassi Rakaaba. Enti Biniyaame koche gidida Ba7aarote addiya Irmoona nayta. Ba7aarotey Biniyaame baggada taybetees. <verse eid="2SA 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3"/>Ba7aarotan de7ida koyro asati Gitayma biitta baqatidi, hachi gakanaw bete asada yan de7idosona.<verse eid="2SA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4"/>Saa7ola na7aa Yoonatanas nam7u tohoy silida na7i de7ees; Saa7olanne Yoonataana hayquwa worey Izra7eelepe si7etiya wode I ichashu laytha na7a. He na7aa dichiyara iya ekada baqatishin na7ay kundin iya tohoy silis; he na7aa sunthay Mempiboste.<verse eid="2SA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5"/>Ba7aarote addiya Irmoona nayti Rekaabinne Ba7aani Iyabuste soo bidi seeta gallas gakidosona. Enti gakiya wode I shempanaw alga bolla zin7is. <verse eid="2SA 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6"/>Enti giste koyiya asada hanidi soo gelidi, iya uluwan caddidosona. Rekaabinne iya ishaa Ba7aani lepara keydi bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7"/>Iyabustey qol7an arsan zin7idaysa demmidi, iyaw uluwan caddidi wodhidosona; iya huuphiya qanxi ekidi, Araba gadha efiya ogiya oykidi, qammara bidosona. <verse eid="2SA 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8"/>Iyabuste huuphiya Kebroonan de7iya Dawitas ehidosona. Kawa, “Nena wodhanaw koyiya ne morkiya Saa7ola na7aa Iyabuste huuphiya haysa be7a. Saa7ola bollanne iya nayta bolla kawa nu godaa gisho Xoossay hachi halo keyis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9"/>Shin Ba7aarote addiya Irmoona nayta Rekaabanne iya ishaa Ba7ana Dawiti haysada yaagis; “Meto ubbaafe tana ashshida de7o Goday eriya mela. <verse eid="2SA 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10"/>Taw mishiraacho odiya asada, ‘Saa7oli hayqis’ yaagidi taw odin, taani iya Xiqilaagan oykada wodhas; taani iya mishiraachuwas immida woytoy haysa. <verse eid="2SA 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11"/>Ba son ba arsan zin7ida xillo addiya wodhida iita asatas iya haluwa keyeysi ay mela iitandesha! Iya suuthaa taani hinte kushepe achana; hintena taani biitta bollafe dhaysana!” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12"/>Rekaabanne Ba7ana wodhana mela Dawiti ba olanchota kiittin, olanchoti enta wodhidosona. Enta kushiyanne tohuwa qanxidi, Kebroonan olla haatha matan kaqidosona. Iyabuste huuphiya efidi, Abeneera duufon Kebroonan moogidosona.<verse eid="2SA 4:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Isra7eele Bolla Kawotis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:1-9">1 Taari 11:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:1-7">14:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1"/>Isra7eele zare ubbay Dawitako Kebroona yidi, “Nuuni ne ashonne ne suuthu. <verse eid="2SA 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2"/>Kase Saa7oli nuus kawo gididi de7iya wodeka Isra7eele asaa olas kaalethiday nena. Goday nena, ‘Neeni ta asaa Isra7eele heemmana; enta bolla kawotana’ yaagidi qaala gelis” yaagidosona. <verse eid="2SA 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3"/>Isra7eele cimati ubbay kawa Dawitako Kebroona yidosona; I entara Kebroonan Godaa sinthan caaqis; Isra7eele bolla kawotana mela Dawita tiyidosona.<verse eid="2SA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4"/>Dawiti kawotiya wode iyaw hastamu laythi; I oytamu laythi kawotis. <verse eid="2SA 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5"/>Kebroonan Yihuda bolla laapun laythinne usupun ageena kawotis; Yerusalaamen Isra7eele bollanne Yihuda bolla hastamanne heedzu laythi kawotis.<verse eid="2SA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6"/>Yerusalaamen de7iya Yaabuse asaa olanaw Dawitinne iya asay bidosona. Yaabuse asay, “Dawiti ha katamaa gelanaw danda7enna” gidi qopida gisho hari attoshin, “Qooqetinne wobbeti nena teqanaw danda7oosona; ne ha katamaa gelaka” yaagidosona. <verse eid="2SA 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7"/>Gidoshin, Dawiti Xiyoonen de7iya enta miixa oykin, iya Dawita katama gidasu.<verse eid="2SA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8"/>He gallas Dawiti, “Yaabuse asaa olidi oykiya oonika Dawita morke gidida wobbetinne qooqeti de7iya bessaa gakanaw shaafara pude keyanaw koshshees” yaagis. Hessa gisho, “Qooqetinne wobbeti gadho gelokona” geetetis. <verse eid="2SA 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9"/>Dawiti he miixaa oykidi, yan de7is; he miixaa Dawita katamaa yaagidi sunthis. Dawiti Miilope doomidi he katamaa yuushshidi gimbis. <verse eid="2SA 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10"/>Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Xoossay iyara de7iya gisho Dawiti minni minni bis.<verse eid="2SA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11"/>Xiroosa kawoy Kiraami Dawitas kawo gadho keexana mela ziga mithi, anaaxetanne shuchu masseyisata yeddin, enti iyaw keethe keexidosona. <verse eid="2SA 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12"/>Goday Isra7eele bolla iya kawo oothidi minthidaysanne ba asaa Isra7eele gisho iya kawotethaa dhoqu oothidi bonchidaysa Dawiti eris.<verse eid="2SA 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13"/>Dawiti Kebroonape Yerusalaame yidaape guye, hara laggethotanne macheta gujidi ekin, hara macca naytinne adde nayti iyaw yeletidosona. <verse eid="2SA 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14"/>Yerusalaamen iyaw yeletida adde nayta sunthay Samu7a, Shobaaba, Naatana, Solomone, <verse eid="2SA 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15"/>Yibhaara, Elishu7a, Nefega, Yafi7a, <verse eid="2SA 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16"/>Elishama7a, Eliyaadanne Elfalaxa.<verse eid="2SA 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Filisxeemeta Xoonis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 14:8-17">1 Taari 14:8-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17"/>Dawiti Isra7eele bolla kawo gididi tiyetidaysa Filisxeemeti si7ida wode enti ubbay Dawita koyanaw keyidosona; shin Dawiti hessa si7idi miixan bidi gelis. <verse eid="2SA 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18"/>Filisxeemeti bidi, Raafayme zangaaran laaletidi uttidosona. <verse eid="2SA 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19"/>Hessa gisho, Dawiti, “Taani bada Filisxeemeta olo? Neeni enta taw aathada immanee?” yaagidi Godaa oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Goday, “Ee ola; tuma ta enta new aathada immana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20"/>Dawiti Ba7al-Parasime geetetiya bessaa bidi, yan enta xoonis. I, “Di7o haathi menthidi keyeysada Goday ta morketa ta sinthan mentherethis” yaagis. Hessa gisho, he bessa sunthay Ba7al-Parasime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ba7al-Parasime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha sunthaa birshethay “Menthidi gelida Godaa” guussu.</char></note> geetetis. <verse eid="2SA 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21"/>Filisxeemeti banta eeqata he bessan yeggidi bin, Dawitinne iya asay he eeqata ekidi bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22"/>Filisxeemeti guye bidi, nam7antho Raafayme zangaaran laaletidi uttidosona. <verse eid="2SA 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23"/>Dawiti Godaa nam7antho oychin, Goday, “Enta guye baggara teqada wolaa sinthan enta ola, shin entaw som7on keyopa. <verse eid="2SA 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24"/>Wola mithaa xeeran salpe qaala neeni si7iya wode Filisxeeme olanchota shocanaw Goday neepe sinthe aadhidaysa erada ellesa” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25"/>Dawiti Goday kiittidaysada oothis; Geebape Gezera gakanaw Filisxeeme olanchota wodhis.<verse eid="2SA 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Taabotey Yerusalaame Simmis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 13:1-14">1 Taari 13:1-14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 15:25-16:6">15:25—16:6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1"/>Isra7eele giddofe dooretida hastamu mukulu asata Dawiti zaaridi shiishis. <verse eid="2SA 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2"/>Dawitinne iya asa ubbay Yihuda Baala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yihuda Baala: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Qiriyaati Yi7aarime guussu.</char></note> katamaape dendidi, kiruubetape giddon ba kawotetha araata bolla uttida Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa sunthan xeegetida Xoossa Taabotiya ehanaw bidosona. <verse eid="2SA 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3"/>Enti Xoossa Taabotiya ooratha gaaren wothidi, dere huuphen de7iya Amnadaabe soope ehidosona. Amnadaabe nayti Oozinne Ahiyoy ooratha gaariya kaalethoosona. <verse eid="2SA 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4"/>Dere huuphen de7iya Amnadaabe soope Xoossa Taabotiya ehiya wode Ahiyoy Taabotiyape sinthara hemetees. <verse eid="2SA 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5"/>Dawitinne Isra7eele asa ubbay diithan, maasinqon, karaabon daalaninne shaashshoten kaa7ishe banta kumetha wolqan Godaa sinthan ufaytidi bonchoosona.<verse eid="2SA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6"/>Naakoni katha bukiya wudumma gakiya wode boorati dhubetin, Oozi ba kushiya yeddidi, Xoossa Taabotiya oykis. <verse eid="2SA 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7"/>Oozi Taabotiya bochida gisho Godaa hanqoy iya bolla eexis. Xoossay iya shocin he bessan Xoossaa Taabotiya matan hayqis. <verse eid="2SA 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8"/>Godaa hanqoy Ooza shocida gisho Dawiti azzanis. He bessay hachi gakanaw Oozi shocetida bessaa geetetees.<verse eid="2SA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9"/>He gallas Dawiti Godaa yayyida gisho “Godaa Taabotey taako waanidi yaanee?” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10"/>Hessa gisho, I Godaa Taabotiya baara Dawita Katamaa ehanaw koybeenna. Hessa aggidi Gaate addiya Abidaara soo efis. <verse eid="2SA 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11"/>Godaa Taabotey Abidaara son heedzu ageena gam7is; Goday Abidaaranne iya soo asaa ubbaa anjis.<verse eid="2SA 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12"/>Xoossa Taabotiya gisho Goday Abidaara soo asaanne iyaw de7iya ubbaa anjidaysa kawoy Dawiti si7is. Hessa gisho, Dawiti Abidaara soo bidi, Xoossa Taabotiya Dawita Katamaa ufaysan ehis. <verse eid="2SA 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13"/>Dawiti Godaa Taabotiya tookida asati usupuna tango tangida wode enta essidi, issi kormanne issi anqara mari yarshis. <verse eid="2SA 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14"/>Dawiti liinope oosetida efuude ma7idi, baw de7iya wolqa ubban Godaa sinthan duris. <verse eid="2SA 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15"/>Dawitinne Isra7eele asa ubbay ufaysan ililishenne moyze punnishe Godaa Taabotiya Dawita Katama ehidosona.<verse eid="2SA 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16"/>Godaa Taabotey Dawita Katama geliya wode Saa7ola na7iya Melkoola maskootera xeellada, kawoy Dawiti Godaa sinthan gupishininne durishin be7ada ba wozanan kadhasu.<verse eid="2SA 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17"/>Dawiti Godaa Taabotiya wothanaw tolida dunkaaniya giddon Taabotiya wothin, Dawiti xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho Godaas yarshis. <verse eid="2SA 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18"/>Dawiti xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho yarshidaape guye Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaa sunthan asaa anjis. <verse eid="2SA 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19"/>Isra7eele asa ubbaas, maccas addes huuphen huuphen issi issi uythi, issi issi qanxo ashonne issi issi woyne nuka gishis. Hessafe guye asa ubbay ba soo soo simmis.<verse eid="2SA 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20"/>Dawiti ba soo asaa anjanaw soo simmida wode Saa7ola na7iya Melkoola iya mokanaw keyada, “Pathonna asati kallo hemeteysada hachi Isra7eele kawoy ba macca aylleta sinthan kallotidi ay mela bonchetide!” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21"/>Dawiti, “Ne aawapenne iya soo asape aathidi ba asaa Isra7eele kaalethana mela tana doorida Godaa sinthan duras. Taani Godaa bonchoos dursa aggike. <verse eid="2SA 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22"/>Taani haysafe aathada buroo tana toochana; tanatethaa ziqi oothana. Shin neeni gida macca aylleta sinthan ta bonchetana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23"/>Saa7ola na7iya Melkoola hayqana gakanaw na7a yelabuuku.<verse eid="2SA 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Dawitas Gelida Qaala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:1-15">1 Taari 17:1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1"/>Kawoy ba gadhon wopu gidi uttidaapenne Goday iya yuushuwan de7iya iya morketape shempisidaape guye, <verse eid="2SA 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2"/>nabiya Naatanako, “Taani zigape keexetida keethan de7ayis, shin Xoossa Taabotey dunkaanen de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3"/>Naatani, “Oothanaw ne wozanan qopidaba ubbaa ootha; Goday neera de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4"/>Shin he qamma Godaa qaalay Naatanako yidi, <verse eid="2SA 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5"/>“Bada ta aylliya Dawita haysada yaaga; ‘Taani daana keethaa keexanay nena gidaka. <verse eid="2SA 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6"/>Taani Isra7eeleta Gibxe biittafe kessida wodepe doomada hachi gakanaw keethan de7abike; taani dunkaanen yaanne haanne yuuyashe de7as. <verse eid="2SA 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7"/>Taani Isra7eele asaara yuuyida bessa ubban ta asa Isra7eele heemmana mela taani shuumida asaa, “Taw ziga mithan ayis keethe keexabikii?” gada oychabike’ yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8"/>“Hiza, ta aylliya Dawitas oda; ‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday neeko haysada yaagees; taani nena hentha bessafe, dorse heemmiya soope denthada ta asaa Isra7eele kaalethana mela oothas. <verse eid="2SA 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9"/>Neeni bida bessa ubban taani neera gidas; ne morketa ubbaa ne sinthafe dhaysas. Ha77i zaarada taani ha sa7an eretida gita asatada ne sunthaa gitayana. <verse eid="2SA 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10"/>Taani ta asaa Isra7eeles besse immada, enta he bessan tokana. Enti banta bessan daana; nam7antho dagammokona. Kase daynnata wodepe doomidi hanidaysada hizape guye enta iita asi haarenna. <verse eid="2SA 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11"/>Taani nena ne morketa ubbaafe shempisana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 7:11">“ ‘Hessa bolla gujidi Goday ba huuphen taani new keethe keexana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ne araatan uttiya sheeshi immana.</char></note> yaagidi odis. <verse eid="2SA 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12"/>Ne barey wurin, hayqada ne mayzata ne gakiya wode ne gulbatape keyida na7a taani denthana; iya kawotethaa minthana. <verse eid="2SA 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13"/>Ta sunthaas keethe keexanay iya; taani iya araata merinaw mintha essana. <verse eid="2SA 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14"/>Taani iyaw aawa gidana; ika taw na7a gidana. I baliya wode taani iya asa xam7an, asi shociya lisson seerana. <verse eid="2SA 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15"/>Shin taani ne sinthafe diggida Saa7olape ta keehatethay eketidaysada iyape kumthi eketenna. <verse eid="2SA 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16"/>Ne kochatinne ne kawotethay ta sinthan merinaw daana; ne araatay merinaw minnidi eqana’ ” yaaga.<verse eid="2SA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17"/>Naatani Goday iyaw qoncethan bessida qaala ubbaa Dawitas odis.<verse eid="2SA 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Woosa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 17:16-27">1 Taari 17:16-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy Dawiti giddo gelidi Godaa sinthan uttidi haysada yaagidi woossis. “Abeeti ta Godaa xoossaw, hachi gakanaw neeni haysa ubbaa oothanaw ta oonee? Ta soo asayka aybee? <verse eid="2SA 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19"/>Abeeti ta Godaw, Xoossaw, haysi ne ayfe sinthan guutha daanin, sinthafe ne aylliya kochatas oothanaba odadasa. Ta Godaa Xoossaw, neeni asara odetiya ogey haysee?<verse eid="2SA 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20"/>“Haysafe aadhiyaba taani, Dawiti ay gaanaw danda7iyana? Ta Godaa Xoossaw, neeni tana ne aylliya eraasa. <verse eid="2SA 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21"/>Neeni ne qaala gisho, ne wozanaa qofaada ha gitaba oothada tana ne aylliya bessadasa.<verse eid="2SA 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22"/>“Abeeti Ta Godaa Xoossaw, neeni gita. Ne meli baawa; nuuni nu haythan si7idaysada neepe attishin, hara xoossi baawa. <verse eid="2SA 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23"/>Ne ase oothanaw Gibxefe wozida ne asaa Isra7eele daaniya hara kawotethi sa7a bolla baawa. Neeni entaw oothida gitanne malaalsiya oosota gaason ne sunthay biittan eretis. Neeni ne asa sinthafe hara kawotethatanne enta xoossata goodda kessadasa. <verse eid="2SA 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24"/>Ne asaa Isra7eele merinaw nebaa oothadasa; minthadasa. Abeeti Godaw, ne enta Xoossa gidadasa.<verse eid="2SA 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25"/>“Abeeti ta Godaw, Xoossaw, neeni ne aylliyasinne iya keethaas oothana gada gelida qaala merinaw naaga; ne qaalatho ootha. <verse eid="2SA 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26"/>Hessan ne sunthay merinaw gita gidana. Asay nena, ‘Ubbaafe Wolqaama Goday Isra7eele Xoossaa’ yaagana. Ne aylliya Dawita kochatika ne sinthan minnidi eqana.<verse eid="2SA 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27"/>“Abeeti Ubbaafe Wolqaama Godaw, Isra7eele Xoossaw, neeni, ‘Ne kochati merinaw kawotana’ yaagada taw ne aylliyas caaqadasa. Hessa gisho, taani ne aylley ha woosa woossanaw xaalas. <verse eid="2SA 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28"/>Abeeti Ta Godaa Xoossaw, neeni Xoosse! Ne qaalay tuma; neeni ha lo77obata oothana gada taw ne aylliyas odadasa. <verse eid="2SA 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29"/>Ne sinthan merinaw daana mela ne aylliya kochaa anja. Abeeti Ta Godaa Xoossaw ne gidaysada ne anjiko ne aylliya keethay merinaw anjetana” yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="2SA 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Xoonota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 18:1-17">1 Taari 18:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy Dawiti Filisxeemeta xoonidi haaris; yaatidi Meteg-Ama katamaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Meteg-Ama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Taarike maxaafan xaafetidaysada Gaatenne iya heeran de7iya gutata bessees.</char></note> Filisxeemeta kushepe ekis.<verse eid="2SA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2"/>Dawiti qassi Moo7abeta xoonis. I enta biittan zin7isidi kushen wadhis; entafe nam7u kushiya wodhidi, heedzantho kushiya paxa aggis. Yaatin Moo7abeti Dawitas haaretidi giiridosona.<verse eid="2SA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3"/>Rehooba na7ay, Suubba kawoy, Adraazari Efraxiisa shaafa matan de7iya ba zawa zaaranaw bida wode Dawiti iya olidi xoonis. <verse eid="2SA 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4"/>Dawiti iya asaape issi mukulunne laapun xeetu para asatanne laatamu mukulu toho asata di77is. Dawiti gaareta goochanaw xeetu parata ashshidi hara parata ubbaas gaadiya gildayis.<verse eid="2SA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5"/>Damasqon de7iya Soore olanchoti Suubba kawa Adraazara maaddanaw yida wode Dawiti entafe laatamanne nam7u mukulu asaa wodhis. <verse eid="2SA 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6"/>Dawiti Soore kawotethan, Damasqon, olanchotas miixa medhis. Yaatin Soore asay Dawitas haaretidi giiridosona. Dawiti bida bessaa ubban Goday iyaw xoono immis.<verse eid="2SA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7"/>Adraazara toora moconati oykiya worqa gondalliya Dawiti ekidi Yerusalaame ehis. <verse eid="2SA 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8"/>Bexahanne Beroota geetetiya Adraazara katamatape kawoy Dawiti daro naase birata ekis.<verse eid="2SA 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9"/>Adraazara olanchota ubbaa Dawiti xoonidaysa Hamaata kawoy To7i si7is. <verse eid="2SA 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10"/>Dawiti Adraazara olidi xoonida wode Hadadizeri To7ara oletishe gam7ida gisho iya hashshu gaanawunne sarothanaw ba na7aa Yoraama Dawitako kiittis. Yoraami worqafe, birapenne naase biratape oosetida imotata Dawitas ehis. <verse eid="2SA 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11"/>Kawoy Dawiti kase giirisiya kawotethata ubbaafe ekida worqanne bira oothidaysada ha imotataka Godaas dummayis. <verse eid="2SA 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12"/>I xoonida kawotethati Edoome, Moo7abe, Amoone, Filisxeemenne Amaaleqa. Hessadaka Rehooba na7aa, Suubba kawa Adraazara ekida di7uwa Godaas dummayis.<verse eid="2SA 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13"/>Maxine zangaaran tammanne hospun mukulu Edoome<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Araame woyko Soore guussu.</char></note> asata Dawiti wodhidi simmidaape guye iya sunthay keyis. <verse eid="2SA 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14"/>Dawiti Edoome biittan olanchota miixa medhis; he biittay Dawitas haaretis. Dawiti bida bessa ubban Goday iyaw xoono immis.<verse eid="2SA 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Moorinnata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15"/>Dawiti Isra7eele ubbaa bolla kawotis; ba asa ubbaa xillotethaninne suure pirdan aysis. <verse eid="2SA 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16"/>Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabi tora mocona gidishin, Ahiluda na7ay Iyosaafexi taarike xaafe. <verse eid="2SA 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17"/>Ahixuuba na7ay Saadoqinne Abyataara na7ay Abimeleke kahine gidishin, Sarayi qassi xaafe. <verse eid="2SA 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18"/>Yoodahe na7ay Banayasi kawa naageysata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kawa naageysata: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kertaawetanne Keltaaweta geetetoosona.</char></note> halaqa gidishin, Dawita adde nayti kawa zoreyisata.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kawa zoreyisata: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woyko kahineta </char></note><verse eid="2SA 8:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawitanne Mempiboste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1"/>Dawiti, “Yoonatana gisho taani iyaw keehatethi oothanaw Saa7ola keethafe attida asi de7isha?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2"/>He wode Siiba geetetiya issi aylley Saa7ola son de7ees. I Dawita sinthe yaana mela xeegin, kawoy, “Neeni Siibee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Siibi, “Ee, taani ne aylliya Siiba” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3"/>Kawoy, “Xoossa keehatethi taani bessaana mela Saa7ola keethafe attida asi baawee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siibi, “Nam7u tohoy silida Yoonataana naytape issoy hanno gakanaw paxa de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4"/>Kawoy, “I awun de7ii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Siibi, “Lodobaara geetetiya bessan Ami7eela na7aa Makira son de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5"/>Kawoy Dawiti Lodobaarape Ami7eela na7aa Makira soope Mempiboste ehisis.<verse eid="2SA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6"/>Saa7ola na7aa Yoonataana na7ay Mempibostey Dawitako yidi, Dawita sinthan ziggidi bonchis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Dawiti, “Mempiboste” yaagidi xeegis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">I, “Abe ta godaw, ta ne aylliya” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7"/>Dawiti, “Yayyofa; ne aawa Yoonataana gisho taani new keehana. Ne aawa aawa Saa7ola gadiya ubbaa taani new zaarana; qassi neeni ubba wode ta gaytape maana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8"/>Mempibostey ziggidi, “Hayqida kana daaniya tana neeni wudada xeellanaw ne aylley taani oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9"/>Kawoy Saa7ola aylliya Siiba xeegidi, “Saa7olabaanne iya soo asaaba gididaba ubbaa taani ne godaa na7aa na7aas immas. <verse eid="2SA 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10"/>Ne godaa na7aa na7ay maana mela neeni, ne naytinne ne aylleti iya gadiya goyidi, kaxida kathaa iyaw ehite. Gidoshin, ne godaa na7aa na7ay Mempibostey ubba wode ta gaytape maana” yaagis. Siibas tammanne ichashu adde naytinne laatamu aylleti de7oosona.<verse eid="2SA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11"/>Siibi, “Neeni ta goday, kawoy ne aylliya kiitida ubbaa taani ne aylley oothana” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Mempibostey kawa naytape issuwa mela kawo gaytape mees.<verse eid="2SA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12"/>Mempibostes Mika geetetiya guutha na7i de7ees. Siiba son de7iya asa ubbay Mempibostes aylle gididosona. <verse eid="2SA 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13"/>Nam7u tohoti silida Mempibostey ubba wode kawa gaytape mishe Yerusalaamen de7is.<verse eid="2SA 9:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Sooretanne Amooneta Xoonis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 19:1-19">1 Taari 19:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1"/>Hessafe guye, Amooneta kawoy hayqin iya na7ay Hanuni iya bessan kawotis. <verse eid="2SA 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2"/>Dawiti, “Iya aaway taw keehidaysada Na7oosa na7aa Hanunas taka keehana” yaagis. Hessa gisho, iya minthethanaw Dawiti ase iyako kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Dawiti kiitida asay Amoone biitta gakida wode, <verse eid="2SA 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3"/>Amoone halaqati banta godaa Hanunako, “Dawiti ha asaa kiittiday ne aawa bonchidi nena minthethanaw koyida gisho daanii? I ase kiittiday ha katamaa wochi be7idi olanaasa” yaagidosona. <verse eid="2SA 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4"/>Hanuni Dawiti kiitida asata oykidi, enta buuchaafe baggaa meedis; enta ma7uwa garsafe dulle gakanaw qanxidi enta yeddis.<verse eid="2SA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5"/>Dawiti hessa si7idi, enti yeellatida gisho, “Hinte buuchay diccana gakanaw Iyaarkon de7ishite; hessafe guye, haa yiite” yaagidi ase kiittis.<verse eid="2SA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6"/>Amooneti Dawiti enta morkidaysa erida wode Beet-Rehoobanne Suubban de7iya Araame asaape laatamu mukulu toho olanchota, Xoobape tammanne nam7u mukulu asatanne Maka kawuwape issi mukulu asata shammidosona.<verse eid="2SA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7"/>Dawiti hessa si7ida wode Iyo7aaba kumetha olanchotara enta bolla yeddis. <verse eid="2SA 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8"/>Amooneti keyidi, katamaa pengiyan olas salpidosona; Suubbafenne Rehoobape yida Araame asati, Xooba asatinne Maka asati denban dumma salpidosona.<verse eid="2SA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9"/>Iyo7aabi bana oli sintharanne guyera teqidaysa be7idi, Isra7eele olanchotape minota dooridi Soore asata sinthan essis. <verse eid="2SA 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10"/>Attida asata ba ishaa Abisi kiittana mela oothidi Amooneta sinthan salpisis. <verse eid="2SA 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11"/>Iyo7aabi Abisako, “Soore asati ta bolla wolqaamiko ne yada tana maadda; Amoone asati ne bolla wolqaamiko ta bada nena maaddana. <verse eid="2SA 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12"/>Hiza minna! Nu asaa gishonne nu Xoossaa katamata gisho, ane minni oletoos. Goday bana lo77iyaba ootho” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13"/>Iyo7aabinne iyara de7iya olanchoti Soore asata olanaw keyidosona; Soore asati iya sinthafe baqatidosona. <verse eid="2SA 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14"/>Soore asati baqatidaysa Amoone asati be7ida wode entika Abisa sinthafe baqatidi, katama gelidosona. Iyo7aabi Amooneta oleysa aggidi, Yerusalaame simmis.<verse eid="2SA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15"/>Soore asati Isra7eele asay enta xoonidaysa erida wode banta olanchota ubbaa shiishidosona. <verse eid="2SA 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16"/>Kawoy Hadadizeri Soore asata Efraxiisa Shaafa hefinthafe kiittidi ehisin, Elama bidosona. Adraazara tora moconay Shobaaki enta kaalethees.<verse eid="2SA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17"/>Dawiti hessa si7ida wode, Isra7eele olanchota shiishidi, Yordaanose shaafa pinnidi Elama gakis. Soore asati besse oykidi, giigidi, Dawitara oletidosona. <verse eid="2SA 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18"/>Shin Soore asati Isra7eeleta sinthafe baqatidosona. Dawiti Soore olanchotape para gaare laagiya laapun xeetu asatanne oytamu mukulu toho olanchota wodhis. Enta toora mocona Sobaakika he bessan shocetidi hayqis. <verse eid="2SA 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19"/>Adrazaras haaretidi de7iya kawoti Isra7eeleti enta xoonidaysa erida wode Isra7eeletara sigetidi, entaw haaretidosona. Hessafe simmin, Soore asati Amoone asata maaddanaw yayyidosona.<verse eid="2SA 10:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawitanne Bersaabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1"/>Laytha laamen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Laytha laame: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isra7eele laytha laamey Maggabitepenne Maazepe giddon de7iya qamma.</char></note> kawoti olas keyiya wode Dawiti ba asaaranne Isra7eele olanchotara issife Iyo7aaba olas yeddis. Enti Amoone olidi, Raaba katamaa teqidosona. Shin Dawiti Yerusalaamen attis.<verse eid="2SA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2"/>Issi gallas omarsi Dawiti ba hiixape dendidi, keethaa bolla de7iya bessaa keyidi hemetishe bolla meecetiya issi maccasi be7is; he maccasiya daro mala lo77o. <verse eid="2SA 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3"/>Dawiti iya ooneko eranaw koyidi ase kiittis. Kiitetida addey, “Iya Eliyaaba na7iw, Hite addiya Ooriyoona machiw Barsaabo” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4"/>Dawiti ase kiittidi, iyo ehisis, iira aqis. He wode iya kushe metoy aadhin, geeyada de7awusu. Iya ba soo simmada basu. <verse eid="2SA 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5"/>Guyepe iya qanthatidaysa erida wode Dawitako, “New qanthatas” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6"/>Dawiti, “Hite addiya Ooriyoona haa yedda” yaagidi Iyo7aabako kiittis. Iyo7aabi Ooriyoona Dawitako yeddis. <verse eid="2SA 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7"/>Ooriyooni yin Dawiti, “Iyo7aabi ay melee? Olanchoti ay melee? Olay waanii?” yaagidi oychis. <verse eid="2SA 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8"/>Dawiti Ooriyoonako, “Soo bada shempa” yaagin, Ooriyooni kawo gadhope keyidi bis. Kawoy Ooriyoona guyera kathi yeddis. <verse eid="2SA 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9"/>Shin Ooriyooni soo boonna kawo gadho dirsa pengiyan ba godaa aylletara aqis.<verse eid="2SA 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10"/>Ooriyooni ba soo boonnaysa Dawiti si7idi, “Neeni haahosoope yadasa gidikii? Ne soo ayis babikii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11"/>Ooriyooni Dawitako, “Taabotey, Isra7eele asay, Yihuda asay, ta halaqay Iyo7aabinne kawa asay denban dunkaanen de7oosona. Yaatin ta waanada soo bada mo, uyo, qassi ta machera waanada aqo? Ne shempoy ero! Taani haysa melaba oothike” yaagidi zaaris.<verse eid="2SA 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12"/>Dawiti, “Issi gallas haysan gam7a; wonto nena guye yeddana” yaagis. Ooriyooni he gallasinne wontetha gallas Yerusalaamen gam7is. <verse eid="2SA 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13"/>Dawiti shoobbin Ooriyooni iyara mis; I mathotana gakanaw Dawiti iya ushshis. Shin he wode omarsi Ooriyooni ba soo boonna, ba hiixa hiixidi ba godaa aylletara aqis.<verse eid="2SA 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14"/>Wontethe Dawiti Iyo7aabas dabdaabe xaafidi, Ooriyoona bolla yeddis. <verse eid="2SA 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15"/>Dawiti ba dabdaabiyan, “Ooriyoona olay goobiya bessan sintha bagga aatha. I shocetidi hayqana mela iya matape haakite” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16"/>Iyo7aabi he katamaa teqida wode I eriya mino morke olanchoti de7iya bessan Ooriyoona essis. <verse eid="2SA 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17"/>Katamaa asati keyidi Iyo7aabara oletidosona. Dawita olanchotape guutha asati hayqidosona; Ooriyooni Hite addeyka hayqis.<verse eid="2SA 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18"/>Iyo7aabi olan hanidaba ubbaa Dawitas kiittis. <verse eid="2SA 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19"/>Iyo7aabi kiitetidi biya addiyako, “Olan hanidaba ne kawas oda wursida wode, <verse eid="2SA 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20"/>kawoy shenetidi, ‘Hinte entara oletanaw katamaako ayis shiiqidetii? Enti gimbiya bolla eqidi dongen dukanaysa ereketii? <verse eid="2SA 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21"/>Gediyoona na7ay Abimelekey waanidi hayqidaako akeekeketii? Mayde gimbiya bollara duge holada Tebesa geetetiya bessan wodhiday issi maccas gidekee? Yaatin, hinte gimbiyako ayis shiiqidetii?’ yaagidi oychiko, neeni, ‘Ne aylley, Hite addey Ooriyoonika hayqis’ ” yaaga.<verse eid="2SA 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22"/>Kiitetidaysi bidi Iyo7aabi kiittidaba ubbaa Dawitas odis. <verse eid="2SA 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23"/>Addey, “Nu morketi nuupe wolqaamidosona; nuura oletanaw katamaa gaxan de7iya demba bessaa keyidosona. Shin nu enta katama pengiya gakanaw guye zaaridi yedethida. <verse eid="2SA 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24"/>Hessafe guye, dongen dukeysati gimbiya bolla gididi ne aylleta dongen dukidosona. Kawaw, ne asatape guuthati hayqidosona; ne aylley, Hite addey Ooriyoonika hayqis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25"/>Dawiti kiitetidaysako, “Neeni Iyo7aabako haysada yaaga; ‘Toori gedeka haaka miya gisho haysas azzanopa; katamaa olada oykanaw minna’ yaagada iya minthetha” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26"/>Ooriyoona machiya ba azinay hayqidaysa si7ida wode iyaw yeekasu. <verse eid="2SA 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27"/>Iya kayo wotha simmin, Dawiti kiittidi iyo ba soo ehis. Iya iyaw macho gidada adde na7a yelasu. Shin Dawiti oothida oosoy iita gidiya gisho Goday ufaytibeenna.<verse eid="2SA 11:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Naatani Dawita Hanqetis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1"/>Goday nabiya Naatana Dawitako kiittin, Naatani iyako yidi, “Issi kataman nam7u asati de7oosona; entafe issoy dure; qassi hankoy manqo. <verse eid="2SA 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2"/>Dure addiyas daro dorsinne mehey de7ees. <verse eid="2SA 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3"/>Shin manqo addiyas shammidi heemmiya issi dorsa mareepe attishin, hari baawa. He dorsiya iya son iya naytara issife diccasu. I ba miya kathaafe muzees; ba uyaa ushshafe ushshees; iya iya ki7one zin7awusu. He dorsiya iyaw macca na7a mela.<verse eid="2SA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4"/>“Issi gallas issi imathi duriya soo yis. Durey ba dorsaafe woyko ba mehepe shukidi, imathe mokanaw koybeenna. Shin I he manqo addiya dorsiw ekidi, he imathaas miyaba giigisis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5"/>Dawiti he dure addiya bolla shene eexidi, “De7o Goday eriya mela, haysa oothida addey hayqanaw bessees. <verse eid="2SA 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6"/>Qassi qadhey bayna I hessa oothida gisho, he dorsa mare gisho oyddu kushe zaaranaw koshshees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7"/>Naatani Dawitako, “He addey nena! Goday Isra7eele Xoossay haysada yaagees; ‘Taani nena Isra7eele bolla tiyada kawothas; Saa7ola kushiyape nena ashshas. <verse eid="2SA 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8"/>Taani ne godaa, Saa7ola keethaa new immas; ne godaa macheta ne ki7on yeggas. Isra7eele asaanne Yihuda asaa taani new immas. Ha ubbay guuxis giiko, taani new haraa guja immanashin. <verse eid="2SA 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9"/>Haysa mela iitabaa Godaa sinthan oothada, ayis Godaa qaala kadhadii? Hite addiya Ooriyoona mashshan wodhadasa; iya machiw ne ekadasa. Amoone asata mashshan iya wodhadasa. <verse eid="2SA 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10"/>Neeni tana kadhada, Hite addiya Ooriyoona machiw ekida gisho ne soo asaape mashshi shaaketenna’ ” yaagees.<verse eid="2SA 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11"/>Goday haysada yaagees; “Taani ne soo asaa giddofe ne bolla iita ehana; ne macheta neeni xeellishin denthada, new matiya addiyas immana; seeta gallas he addey ne machetara zin7ana. <verse eid="2SA 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12"/>Neeni hessa geeman oothadasa; shin taani seeta gallas Isra7eele asa ubbaa sinthan oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13"/>Yaatin, Dawiti, “Taani Godaa bolla nagara oothas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Naatani, “Goday ne nagaraa atto gis; neeni hayqaka. <verse eid="2SA 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14"/>Shin ne haysa oothada, Godaa morketi iya kadhana mela oothida gisho yeletida na7ay tuma hayqana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15"/>Naatani ba soo bidaape guye, Ooriyoona machiya Dawitas yelida na7aa Goday shocin I hargis. <verse eid="2SA 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16"/>Dawiti ba na7aa gisho Xoossaa woossis; Dawiti xoomis; ba kifiliya gelidi qamma qamma sa7an zin7i aqees. <verse eid="2SA 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17"/>Iya soo cimati iya sa7ape dendana mela iya matan eqidi woossidosona; shin I dendonna ixis; I entara kathi mibeenna.<verse eid="2SA 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18"/>Laapuntha gallas na7ay hayqis. Dawita aylleti na7aa hayquwa odanaw yayyidi, “Na7ay paxa de7ishin nuuni Dawita odisin, si7onna ixis. Yaatin, na7ay hayqidaysa nuuni waatidi iyaw odanee? Ooni eri, I bana qohanekoshii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19"/>Ba aylleti issoy issuwara kalkasheysa Dawiti si7ida wode na7ay hayqidaysa eris. Dawiti, “Na7ay hayqidee?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Enti, “Ee hayqis” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20"/>Yaatin, Dawiti sa7ape dendidi meecetis; qibaate tiyetis; ba ma7uwa laammidi, Godaa keethi gelidi goyinnis. Hessafe guye ba soo bidi, kathi oychin, enti iya sinthe aathin mis.<verse eid="2SA 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21"/>Iya aylleti, “Neeni haysada ayis hanadii? Na7ay paxa de7ishin xoomadasanne yeekadasa; shin na7ay hayqin dendada, kathi madasa” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22"/>Dawiti, “Na7ay paxa de7ishin taani xoomasinne yeekas; Goday tana maarin, na7ay paxanekonne” gada qopas. <verse eid="2SA 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23"/>Shin, “Na7ay hayqin, taani ayis xoomo? Taani na7aa guye zaaranaw danda7iyana? Taani iyako baana, I taako yeenna” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti ba machiw Barsaabo minthethis. Dawiti iiko gelidi iira aqis; iya iyaw adde na7a yelasu. Na7aa Solomone gidi sunthis; Goday he na7aa dosis. <verse eid="2SA 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25"/>Goday na7aa dosida gisho, iya sunthaa “Yididiya” gidi sunthana mela nabiya Naatana kiittis.<verse eid="2SA 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26"/>He wode Iyo7aabi Amooneta katama Raaba olidi kawo miixaa oykis. <verse eid="2SA 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27"/>Iyo7aabi Dawitako, “Taani Raaba katama olada, haathe duuqiya bessaa oykas. <verse eid="2SA 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28"/>Ha77i attida olanchota shiishada katama olada oyka. Hessi hanonna ixiko, taani katamaa oykada ta sunthan xeegetana mela oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29"/>Dawiti ba olanchota ubbaa shiishidi, Raaba katama bidi, olidi oykis. <verse eid="2SA 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30"/>Enta kawa kallachaa iya huuphepe ekis. He worqa kallachay hastamanne ichashu kilo giraame deexees. Iya giddon inqo geetetiya al7o shuchi de7ees. He kallacha Dawiti huuphen wothis. Dawiti katamaape daro di7o di77is. <verse eid="2SA 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31"/>He kataman de7iya asaa kessidi, magaazen, birata konteninne birata kaltan oothana mela oothis. Qassi enti xuube medhana mela oothis. Amoone katama ubban de7iya asaa I haysada oothis. Hessafe guye, Dawitinne iya olanchoti Yerusalaame simmidosona.<verse eid="2SA 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Amnoonanne Timaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1"/>Issi wode haysada hanis. Dawita na7aa Abeseloomes Timaaro geetetiya issi mala lo77o micha de7awusu. Dawita na7ay Amnooni Timaaro dosis. <verse eid="2SA 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2"/>Amnooni ba michiw Timaaro dosida gisho iyo qopishe daro gilqis. Iya geela7o gidida gisho iyo aykoka oothanaw danda7etonnaba iyaw daanis.<verse eid="2SA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3"/>Shin Amnoonas Dawita ishaa Saama na7aa Iyonadaaba geetetiya laggey de7ees; Iyyonadaabi daro eca asi. <verse eid="2SA 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4"/>Iyyonadaabi, “Neeni kawo na7a gidashe wonta wonta ayis gilqay? Neeni taw ayis odikii?” yaagidi Amnoona oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Amnooni, “Ta ishaa Abeseloome michiw Timaaro taani dosas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5"/>Iyyonadaabi, “Hargetiya asada hanada hiixan zin7a. Ne aaway nena be7anaw yaa wode, ‘Ta michiya Timaara yada taw miyaba immo; taani iyo be7ishin ta sinthan kathada tana barso’ yaagada oycha” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6"/>Amnooni hargetida asada hanidi hiixan zin7is. Kawoy iya be7anaw yaa wode Amnooni, “Ta michiya Timaara yada, ta be7ishin ta sinthan uythi uukada tana ba kushera barso” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7"/>Dawiti, kawo gadhon de7iya Timaariko kiittidi, “Ne ishaa Amnoona soo bada iyaw kathi katha” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8"/>Timaara ba ishaa Amnoona soo basu; he wode I hiixan zin7is. Timaara guutha dhiille munuqada Amnooni be7ishin uythi uukasu. <verse eid="2SA 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9"/>Timaara uythaa bashepe kessada iyaw aathasu; shin I moonna ixis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:9">Amnooni, “Asa ubbaa kare kessite” yaagin, asa ubbay iya matape keyis. <verse eid="2SA 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10"/>Hessafe guye, Amnooni, “Taani ne kushepe maana mela kathaa haa qol7a ekada ya” yaagis. Timaara ba uukida uythaa ekada, ba ishaa Amnoona sinthe shiishasu. <verse eid="2SA 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11"/>Timaara kathaa iyako shiishiya wode iyo oykidi, “Ta miche, haaya! Taara zin7a” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12"/>Iya, “Ta ishaw, akay hanenna! Tana wolqanthofa! Haysa melabay Isra7eelen hani erenna; haysa mela borsoba oothofa. <verse eid="2SA 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13"/>Ta pokuwa taani waatada genthanaw danda7iyana? Qassi neka Isra7eele giddon kawusha asi gidana. Hayyana kawa oycha; taani nena gelanaysa I diggenna” yaagasu. <verse eid="2SA 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14"/>Shin I iyo si7onna ixis. I wolqaama gidiya gisho, iyo wolqan oykidi iissis.<verse eid="2SA 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15"/>Hessafe guye, Amnooni iyo daro ixis; kase iyo dosidaysafe aathidi ixis. Amnooni, denda, “Keya! Keyada ba!” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16"/>Iya, “Neeni tana keyada ba geysi kase ne ta bolla oothida iitaape aadhees” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Shin I iyo si7onna ixis. <verse eid="2SA 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17"/>Amnooni ba aylliya xeegidi, “Ha maccasiw ta sinthafe kessa; iyo kare kessada wulaa gorda” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18"/>Aylley iyo kare kessidi wulaa gordis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:18">Geela7o gidida kawo macca nayti ma7iya alleeqo ma7o ma7asu. <verse eid="2SA 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19"/>Timaara bido ba huuphen qolada, ba ma7ida alleeqo ma7uwa daakada; ba huuphiya oykada, waaso goochashe basu.<verse eid="2SA 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20"/>I ishaa Abeseloomey iyo be7ida wode, “Ne ishay Amnooni nena iissidee? Ta miche, neeni ha77i si77i ga. I ne ishaa; ha odaa ne ulon oykofa” yaagis. Yaatin, Timaara azzanashe, asan keyonna ba ishaa Abeseloome son de7asu.<verse eid="2SA 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21"/>Kawoy Dawiti ha odaa si7ida wode daro yilotis. <verse eid="2SA 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22"/>Abeseloomey Amnoonako camma mal7a pogibeenna. Ba michiw Timaaro iissida gisho Amnoona morkis.<verse eid="2SA 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abeseloomey Amnoona Wodhis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23"/>Nam7u laythafe guye, Efreema zawa matan Haxoora geetetiya bessane Abeseloomey dorsa ikise meedees. Kawa adde nayti ubbay he bessaa yaana mela Abeseloome enta xeegis. <verse eid="2SA 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24"/>Abeseloomey kawako bidi, “Taani ne aylley ta dorsata ikisiya meedisayis; nenne ne moorinnati nuura yedherketii?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25"/>Kawoy, “Akay, ta na7aw! Nu ubbay biiko, new tooho gidana” yaagis. Abeseloomey kawa daro shoobbinka kawoy boonna ixis; shin Abeseloome anjis.<verse eid="2SA 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26"/>Abeseloomey, “Neeni boonna ixiko, ta ishaa Amnooni nuura boo” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Kawoy, “I neera ayis bii?” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27"/>Shin Abeseloomey shoobbidi aggonna ixin, Dawiti Amnoonanne ba adde nayta iyara yeddis.<verse eid="2SA 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28"/>Abeseloomey ba aylletako, “Amnooni woyne uyidi mathotiya wode taani hintena, ‘Amnoona shocite’ yaagada kiittiya wode iya wodhite. Yayyofite! Hintena kiittey tana. Minnite! Xaalite!” yaagidi kiittis. <verse eid="2SA 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29"/>Abeseloome aylleti I kiittidaysada Amnoona wodhidosona. Hessafe guye, kawa adde nayti ubbay dendidi, banta baquluwa baquluwa toggidi baqatidosona.<verse eid="2SA 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30"/>Enti buroo oge bolla de7ishin, “Abeseloomey kawa nayta ubbaa wursis; entafe issoyka attibeenna” geetetiya worey Dawita gakis. <verse eid="2SA 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31"/>Kawoy dendi eqidi, azzanidi, ba ma7uwa daakidi biittan zin7is. Iya aylleti ubbay banta ma7uwa daakidi, iya matan eqidosona.<verse eid="2SA 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32"/>Dawita ishaa Saama na7ay Iyyonadaabi, “Ta godaw, kawo nayti ubbay hayqidosona gada qopofa; Amnoona xalaali hayqis. Amnooni ba michiw Timaaro iissida gallasape doomin, Abeseloomey iya bolla oothanaw qopidabay hanis. <verse eid="2SA 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33"/>Hiza hayqiday Amnoona xalaala gidiya gisho, ‘Kawa adde nayti ubbay hayqidosona’ giya woriya kawoy tuma goopo” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34"/>He wode Abeseloomey baqatis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:34">Naagiya addey dhoqu gidi xeelliya wode wuloha baggara de7iya ogiyara dere lanqiya oykidi daro asay yeysa be7idi kawas odis. <verse eid="2SA 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35"/>He wode Iyyonadaabi, “Heko, taani ne aylley odidaysada kawa adde nayti yidosona” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36"/>I odi wursiya wode kawa adde nayti gelidi banta qaala dhoqu oothidi waassidosona. Qassi kawoynne iya moorinnati ubbay yibbata yeeho yeekidosona.<verse eid="2SA 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37"/>Abeseloomey baqatidi, Geshura kawo gidida Amhuda na7aa Talmayako bis. Shin kawoy Dawiti ba na7aas daro gallas yeekis.<verse eid="2SA 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38"/>Abeseloomey baqatidi Geshura biitta bidaape guye yan heedzu laythi de7is. <verse eid="2SA 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39"/>Kawoy Dawiti Amnoona hayquwan gakida azzaniyape minnida gisho, Abeseloome be7anaw laamotis.<verse eid="2SA 13:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Abeseloomey Yerusalaame Simmis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1"/>Xaruya na7ay Iyo7aabi Kawoy Dawiti Abeseloome laamotidaysa eris. <verse eid="2SA 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2"/>Hessa gisho, Iyo7aabi Tequhe katamaa kiittidi, issi cinca maccas ehisis. Iiko, “Neeni kayotiya asada hana; kayo ma7o ma7a; qibaate tiyettofa; daro wodepe doomidi, hayqida asas kayotiya maccasada hana. <verse eid="2SA 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3"/>Kawako bada ha qaala iyaw oda” yaagis. Iyo7aabi iya kawas odanaba iw odis.<verse eid="2SA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4"/>Tequhe maccasiya kawako bada biittan gufannada, “Kawaw, tana maaddarki!” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5"/>Kawoy, “Nena aybe metiday?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Iya, “Taani azini hayqida maccas. <verse eid="2SA 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6"/>Taw ne ayllees nam7u adde nayti de7oosona. Enti issoy issuwara denban wadhetidosona; enta shaakanaw asi dhayin, issoy issuwa shocidi wodhis. <verse eid="2SA 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7"/>Ta dabboti ubbay ta bolla dendidi, ‘Ba ishaa I wodhida gisho nuuni iya wodhana mela ba ishaa wodhida uraa nuus hamma; yaatidi nuuni laattiya asi dhaysana’ yaagidosona. Enti taw laatas attida issi duncha toysoosona; ta azinaa sunthaanne iya kochaa biittafe dhaysoosona” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8"/>Kawoy maccaseeko, “Ne soo ba; ta ne gisho kiittana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9"/>Shin Tequhe maccasiya, “Ta godaw, kawaw, gomey tananne ta aawa soo asaa oyko; shin kawoynne iya araatay geeshshi gido” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10"/>Kawoy, “Ne bolla doona pogiya oonaka taako eha; I nena nam7antho bochenna” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11"/>Maccasiya, “Suuthu zaariya uray qoho bolla qoho ehonadanne ta na7aaka wodhonnaada kawoy Godaa, ba Xoossaa sunthan taw caaqo” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Kawoy, “De7o Goday eriya mela, ne na7aa binaanape issoyka sa7an wodhenna” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12"/>Maccasiya zaarada, “Ta godaw, ta kawaw, ta issiba odeto” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Kawoy, “Haasaya” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13"/>Maccasiya, “Yaatin, neeni Xoossa deriya bolla haysa mela qoho ayis oothadii? Kawoy dhayida ba na7aa guye zaaribeenna. Ba odida qaalan kawoy bala gidennee? <verse eid="2SA 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14"/>Nu ubbay hayqana; gukida haathi simmonnaysada nu simmoko. Shin Xoossay shempo dhayo dosenna; dogetida asi kumethi dhayonna mela iyaw oge giigisees.<verse eid="2SA 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15"/>“Tana asay yashisiya gisho ta godaa, kawas, haysa odanaw ha77i yas. ‘Taani ne aylliya, taani kawas odana; ooni eri, taani iya aylliya oychidaba kawoy oothonna aggenna. <verse eid="2SA 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16"/>Kawoy si7idi, Xoossay nuus immida laatape tananne ta na7aa dhaysanaw koyiya asaa kushepe ashshana’ gada qopas. <verse eid="2SA 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17"/>Hessadaka kawoy lo77onne iita shaakanaw Xoossa kiitancho mela gidiya gisho, ta godaa kawa qaalay tana shempiso. Goday, ne Xoossay neera gido” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18"/>Kawoy, “Taani nena oychana; neeni taape qottofa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Maccasiya, “Ta goday, kawoy odeto” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19"/>Kawoy maccasiw, “Haysa ubban Iyo7aaba kushey neera de7ii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Maccasiya, “Ta godaw, kawaw, ne shempoy ero! Neeni ta goday, kawoy, odida ubbaafe ushachi woyko haddirsi gaanaw danda7iya asi baawa. Ee, haysa tana kiittiday, ne aylle doonan haysa wothiday ne aylliya Iyo7aaba. <verse eid="2SA 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20"/>Ne aylley Iyo7aabi haysa oothiday ha77i de7iya hanota laammanaasa. Kawaw, new Xoossa kiitancho mela cinca gidiya gisho biittan haniyaba ubbaa eraasa” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21"/>Kawoy Iyo7aabako, “Lo77o! Taani haysa oothana! Bada he na7atetha Abeseloome ekada ya” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22"/>Iyo7aabi kawa sinthan gufannidi, “Ta godaw, kawaw, ba aylley oychidaba oothanaw ero gida gisho, ne sinthan saba demmidaysa ne aylley hachi eris” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23"/>Hessafe guye, Iyo7aabi dendidi Geshura bidi Abeseloome Yerusalaame ekidi yis. <verse eid="2SA 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24"/>Shin kawoy, “Abeseloomey ba soo baanaw bessees; I ta som7on keyopo” yaagis. Abeseloomey ba soo bis; kawa som7uwa be7ibeenna.<verse eid="2SA 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25"/>Isra7eele giddon mala lo77otethan Abeseloome mela sabetida asi baawa. Huuphepe toho gakanaw iyan boriyabay baawa. <verse eid="2SA 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26"/>I bana deexiya wode ba huuphiya qanxisees. Ba huuphiya qanxisiya wode ubban mizaanen mazzanees; iya binaanay kawo mizaane liken nam7u kilo giraamepe aadhees. <verse eid="2SA 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27"/>Abeseloomes heedzu adde na7inne issi macca na7i yeletidosona; macca na7e sunthay Timaaro; iya mala lo77o na7a.<verse eid="2SA 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28"/>Abeseloomey nam7u laythi kumethi kawa som7o be7onna Yerusalaamen de7is. <verse eid="2SA 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29"/>Abeseloomey, “Taani nena kawako kiittanaw koyiya gisho taako haaya” yaagidi Iyo7aabako kiittis; shin Iyo7aabi yoonna ixis. Nam7antho kiittis; shin Iyo7aabi ha77ika yoonna ixis. <verse eid="2SA 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30"/>Abeseloomey ba aylletako, “Heko, ta gadiya matan Iyo7aabas gadey de7ees; iyan bangi de7ees. Bidi iyan tama yeddite” yaagis. Abeseloome aylleti Iyo7aaba bangan tama yeddidosona.<verse eid="2SA 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31"/>Iyo7aabi Abeseloome soo bidi, “Ne aylleti ta bangan ayis tama yeddidonaa?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32"/>Abeseloomey, “Ta xeegin ne yoonna ixida gishosa. Neeni kawako bada, ‘Taani Geshurape ayis yadina? Taani hanno gakanaw yan de7idaako lo77oshin’ yaagees gada taw oychana mela koyas. Ha77i taani kawa som7o be7anaw koyayis; taani bala gidiko, I tana wodho” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33"/>Iyo7aabi kawako bidi, Abeseloomey gidaysa odis. Kawoy Abeseloome xeegisis; Abeseloomey soo gelidi, kawa sinthan gufannidi ziggis; kawoy Abeseloome yeeris.<verse eid="2SA 14:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Abeseloome Maquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1"/>Hessafe guye, Abeseloomey issi para gaare, paratanne ba sinthan woxanaw ishatamu asata giigisis. <verse eid="2SA 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2"/>Abeseloomey guura dendidi, katamaa pengiyan eqees. Mootoy de7iya ay asika kawa sinthe pirdas biya wode Abeseloomey xeegidi, “Neeni awu katamape yay?” yaagidi oychees. He uray, “Ta ne aylley Isra7eele zare issuwafe yas” yaagidi iyaw zaarees. <verse eid="2SA 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3"/>Abeseloomey, “Heko, ne oday lo77onne suure; shin kawa baggafe nena si7anay baawa” yaagees. <verse eid="2SA 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4"/>Abeseloomey gujidi, “Ta Isra7eele bolla pirdanaw shuumetidaba gidarkinashin. Hessi hanidaako, mootoy woyko odi de7iya oonika taako yin, taani iyaw suure pirda pirdanashin” yaagees.<verse eid="2SA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5"/>Oonika iyako yidi iyaw ziggiya wode Abeseloomey ba kushiya yeddidi he addiya oykidi yeerees. <verse eid="2SA 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6"/>Pirdetanaw kawako yaa Isra7eele ubbaas Abeseloomey hessada hanidi Isra7eele asaa wozanaa ekis.<verse eid="2SA 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7"/>Oyddu laythafe guye, Abeseloomey, “Taani Godaas qangida qangetha gathanaw Kebroona baana. <verse eid="2SA 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8"/>Taani ne aylley Soore biittan Geshura kataman de7ashe, ‘Tana Goday Yerusalaame guye zaariko, Godaas goyinnana’ yaagada qangas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9"/>Kawoy, “Saro ba” gin, I dendidi Kebroona katamaa bis.<verse eid="2SA 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10"/>Shin Abeseloomey Isra7eele zare ubbaas qosan kiita yeddidi, “Moyze puno hinte si7ida wode, ‘Abeseloomey Kebroonan kawotis’ yaagite” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11"/>Abeseloomey xeegin, Yerusalaamepe iyara bida asata tayboy nam7u xeeta. Enti he hanotaba aykoka eronna ashketethan bidosona. <verse eid="2SA 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12"/>Abeseloomey yarsho yarshiya wode Dawita zoriya asaape issuwa Akxoofela Gilo katamaape xeegisis. Kawa bolla dendida maqoy goobis; Abeseloome kaalliya asaa tayboy guji guji bis.<verse eid="2SA 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Baqatis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13"/>Issi kiitetida asi yidi Dawitako, “Isra7eele asaa wozanay Abeseloomera de7ees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14"/>Dawiti baara Yerusalaamen de7iya ba moorinnatako, “Dendite! Nuuni baqatoos! Yaanona ixiko, nu giddofe ay asika Abeseloomepe kessi ekenna. Nuuni ellesidi baanaw koshshees; hankoode, I ellesi yidi nuna dhaysana; nu katama mashshan buthana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15"/>Kawa moorinnati, “Nu goday, kawoy doorida ubbaa nuuni ne aylleti oothanaw giigidi uttida” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16"/>Kawoy keydi tohora bis; iya soo asaynne iya moorinnati ubbay iyara bis; shin ba gadhuwa naagana mela tammu laggethota son ashshis. <verse eid="2SA 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17"/>Kawoy keyin asa ubbay iyara haahon de7iya issi keetha matan eqidosona. <verse eid="2SA 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18"/>Iya asati ubbay iyape sinthara salpidi aadhidosona; enta kaallidi kawa naageysati salpidosona. Qassi enta kaallidi Gaate katamaape yida usupun xeetu asati, kawa sinthara salpidi aadhidosona.<verse eid="2SA 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19"/>Kawoy Gaate addiya Itayako, “Neeni nuura ayis yay? Guye simmada, kawa Abeseloomera de7aasha. Neeni asa biitta asi; ne di7etada yida asi. <verse eid="2SA 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20"/>Neeni zine yadasa; taani ta huuphen biya soo eronna de7ashe, nena waatada daaburso? Guye simma; ne biitta asi neera efa. Goday new keehonne ammaneto!” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21"/>Shin Itayi, “De7o Goday eriya mela, ta goday kawoy eriya mela, ta goday kawoy de7iya awunka, paxan gidin hayqon taani ne aylley neepe shaaketike” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22"/>Dawiti, “Lo77o! Ba, aadha” yaagis. Gaate addey Itayi asaaranne naytara asa ubbaara bis.<verse eid="2SA 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23"/>He asa ubbay biya wode he biitta asay banta qaala dhoqu oothidi yeekidosona. Kawoy Qediroona zangaara pinnis; asa ubbay mela biittako simmidi bis.<verse eid="2SA 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24"/>Kahiney Saadoqi he bessan de7ees; Xoossa caaqo Taabotiya tookiya Leewetinne kahiniya Abyataari yan de7oosona. Asa ubbay katamaape keyidi wurana gakanaw Xoossa Taabotiya sa7an shempisidosona.<verse eid="2SA 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25"/>Hessafe guye, kawoy Saadoqako, “Xoossa Taabotiya katama guye zaara. Goday tanan ufaytiyaba gidiko, issi gallas guye zaaridi ba Taabotiyanne ba keethaa bessaana. <verse eid="2SA 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26"/>Shin i, ‘Nenan ufaytike’ giiko, I bana lo77iyaba ootho; taani giigeta uttas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27"/>Qassi kawoy kahiniya Saadoqako, ane akeeka “Neeni ne na7aa Akmaasanne Abyataara na7aa Yoonataana ekida katamaa saro ba. <verse eid="2SA 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28"/>Hinte taw kiittana gakanaw taani mela biittan de7iya shaafa pinuwan de7ashshana” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29"/>Hessa gisho, Saadoqinne Abyataari Xoossa Taabotiya Yerusalaame guye efidi yan de7idosona.<verse eid="2SA 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30"/>Shin Dawiti yeekishe Shamaho deriya bolla keyis. I azzanon ba huuphiya guuluntidi mela tohon hemetis; iyara de7iya asati guuluntidi yeekishe pude keyidosona. <verse eid="2SA 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31"/>Akxoofeli Abeseloomera maqetidaysa Dawiti si7ida wode “Godaw, Akxoofela zoriya eeyatethi laamma” yaagidi woossis.<verse eid="2SA 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32"/>Dawiti asay Xoossaa goyinniya zumaa huuphe gakida wode, Arkaya addiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arkaya addiya geysi besse gidonashin koche gidanaw danda7ees.</char></note> Kuussi ba ma7uwa daakidi, ba huuphiyan baana qolidi, Dawitara gahetanaw yis. <verse eid="2SA 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33"/>Dawiti, “Neeni taara biiko taw tooho gidana. <verse eid="2SA 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34"/>Shin neeni katamaa guye simmada Abeseloomeko, ‘Kawaw, haysafe kase taani ne aawa aylle gididaysada ha77i newuka aylle gidana’ yaagiko, Akxoofela zoriya laallada tana maaddana. <verse eid="2SA 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35"/>Kahineti Saadoqinne Abyataari neera yan de7oosona gidokona? Neeni kawo gadhon si7iyaba ubbaa entaw oda. <verse eid="2SA 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36"/>Saadoqa na7aa Akmaasinne Abyataara na7aa Yoonataani yan entara de7oosona; neeni si7iyaba ubbaa enta bolla taw kiitta” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37"/>Abeseloomey Yerusalaame gelishin, Dawita laggey Kuussi katama gakis.<verse eid="2SA 15:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawitanne Siiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1"/>Dawiti deriya huuphiyara hefinthi aadhishin, Siiba geetetiya Mempiboste aylley iyara gahetis. Nam7u xeetu uythu, issi xeetu zabibe nuka, issi xeetu tiya ayfe, issi ogoro woyne ushshu nam7u haretan caanis.<verse eid="2SA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2"/>Kawoy, “Haysa ayis ehadii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siibi, “Hareta, kawa soo asay toggana mela, uythaanne tiyiya ayfiya asay maana melanne woyne ushshay bazzon daaburiya asati uyana melasa” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3"/>Kawoy, “Ne godaa na7aa na7ay awun de7ii?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Siibi, “ ‘Isra7eele asay ta aawa kawotethaa hachi taw zaari immana’ yaagidi Yerusalaamen uttis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4"/>Kawoy, “Mempibostes de7iyaba ubbay new gido” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Siibi, “Abeeti godaw, kawaw! Taani ne sinthan teemo demmayis” yaagidi biittan gufannida ziggayis.<verse eid="2SA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawitanne Saami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5"/>Kawoy Dawiti Biraqima katama yaa wode Saa7ola dabbo gidida issi addey yaape keyis. Iya sunthay Geera na7aa Saami. I Dawita baaddishe keyis. <verse eid="2SA 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6"/>Olanchotinne kawa naageysati ushacharanne haddirsara Dawita teqidi de7ishin, Saami Dawita bollanne kawa moorinnata bolla shuchu holis. <verse eid="2SA 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7"/>Saami Dawita baaddishe, “Kicha; ha iitay kicha! Asa suuthu gussiya ha pathonaysi kicha. <verse eid="2SA 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8"/>Neeni Saa7ola bessan kawotadasa; neeni gussida Saa7ola soo asaa suutha ubbaa Goday ne bolla zaaris. Goday kawotethaa ne na7aa Abeseloomes immis; neeni suuthu gussida asi gidiya gisho, new dhayo wodey gakis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9"/>Hessafe guye, Xaruya na7ay Abisi, Kawako, “Ha bawuta kanay, ta godaa kawa ayis baaddii? Taani bada iya qoodhiya qanxana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10"/>Kawoy, “Hinteno, Xaruya nayto, hintera taara aybi gathii? Goday, ‘Dawita baadda’ yaagida gisho I baaddiyaba gidiko, ‘Neeni ayis hessa oothay?’ yaagidi oychanaw danda7ey oonee?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11"/>Hessafe guye, Dawiti Abisanne ba moorinnata, “Ta na7ay, ta ashoy, tana wodhanaw koyees; yaatin, ha Biniyaame addey waati aggane! Goday iya kiitida gisho I baaddees, iya bochofite. <verse eid="2SA 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12"/>Ooni eri, Goday ta metuwa be7idi, taani hachi ekiya baadetha gisho taw keeha qopaneeko” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13"/>Hessafe guye, Dawitinne iya asay ogiya oykidi boosona. Saami zumaa miyara bishe Dawita baaddees; shuchu holees; iya bolla biitta laallees. <verse eid="2SA 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14"/>Kawoynne iyara de7iya asati banta biya bessa daaburidi gakin kawoy yan shempis.<verse eid="2SA 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abeseloomenne Iya Moorinnata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15"/>Abeseloomeynne Isra7eele asa ubbay Yerusalaame gelidosona; Akxoofeli entara de7ees. <verse eid="2SA 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16"/>Dawita laggey Arkaya kochay Kuussi Abeseloomeko yidi, “Kawoy birata tuussu gido! Kawoy mukulu laythi kawoto!” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17"/>Abeseloomey, “Neeni ne laggiya dosiya dosoy haysee? Ne laggiyara ayis babikii?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18"/>Kuussi, “Akay! Goday, ha asaynne Isra7eele asay dooridaysas taani aqana; taani iyara attana. <verse eid="2SA 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19"/>Hiza taani ta godaa na7aas oothonna ooddes oothanee? Taani ne aawas oothidaysada ha77i newuka oothana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20"/>Abeseloomey Akxoofelako, “Neeni ane nuna zora; nuuni ay oothino?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21"/>Akxoofeli, “Kawo gadho naaganaw son attida ne aawa laggethotara bada zin7a. Neeni ne aawa kawushidaysa Isra7eele asa ubbay si7ana; neera de7iya ubbaa kushey minnana” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22"/>Kawo keethaa pooqiya bolla Abeseloomes dunkaane tokidosona; asa ubbay xeellishin Abeseloomey gelidi ba aawa laggethotara zin7is.<verse eid="2SA 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23"/>He wode Akxoofeli zoriya zorey issi asi Godaa oychidi ekiya zore mela. Dawitinne Abeseloomey Akxoofela zoriya hessada oothidi ekidosona.<verse eid="2SA 16:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1"/>Hessafe guye, Akxoofeli, “Hachi qamma taani tammanne nam7u mukulu asata doorada Dawita yedethada oykana. <verse eid="2SA 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2"/>I daaburidi wolqa dhayidi de7ishin taani iya bolla wodhana. Taani iya daganthana; yan iyara de7iya asa ubbay baqatiya wode taani kawa xalaala shocana. <verse eid="2SA 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3"/>Yaatada taani asa ubbaa neeko zaarana. Neeni issi asa xalaala wodhanaw koyaasa; hanko asay saro attana” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4"/>Akxoofela zorey Abeseloomenne Isra7eele cimata ubbaa ufaysis.<verse eid="2SA 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5"/>Abeseloomey, “Qassi Arkaya kocha Kuussa xeegite; I giyaba ane si7oos” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6"/>Kuussi iyako yida wode Abeseloomey, “Akxoofeli zorida zorey haysa; nuuni I giyaba oothanaw bessii? Bessonnaba gidiko, ne qofay aybee?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7"/>Kuusi, “Akxoofeli zorida zorey ha wodiyan lo77o gidenna. <verse eid="2SA 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8"/>Ne aawaynne ne aawa asati mino olanchota gideysanne ba marata bonqetida maahe mela yashsheyisata gideysa neeni eraasa. Ne aaway ola meezetida asi; I qamma ba olanchotara aqena. <verse eid="2SA 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9"/>I hannoode gongolo giddon woyko hara bessan qosetidi uttis. I hinte cugata koyrottidi qohiko, hessa si7ida oonika, ‘Abeseloome kaallidi bida asay shocetidosona’ yaagana. <verse eid="2SA 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10"/>Ne aaway toora qara gideysanne iyara de7iya asay mino gideysa Isra7eele asa ubbay eriya gisho, hari attoshin gaammoda minota wozanay til7ana.<verse eid="2SA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11"/>“Shin taani nena zorey haysa; abba gaxan de7iya shafe mela darida, Daanepe Barsaabe gakanaw de7iya Isra7eele ubbaa neeko shiisha; yaatada neeni enta olas kaaletha. <verse eid="2SA 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12"/>Nuuni iya demmida bessa awunka shocana; aki sa7an wodhiyada nuuni iya bolla wodhana. Iya gidin woyko iyara de7iya asaa gidin issoyka paxa attenna. <verse eid="2SA 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13"/>I katamaa gelikoka, Isra7eele asa ubbay wodoro ehidi, katamaa giddon issi shuchi aggonna he katamaa goochidi zangaaran yeggana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14"/>Abeseloomeynne Isra7eele asa ubbay, “Arkaya kocha Kuussa zorey Akxoofela zoriyape lo77o” yaagidosona. Goday Abeseloome bolla iitabaa ehanaw qopidi gisho Akxoofela zoriya ekonnaada oothis.<verse eid="2SA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15"/>Kuussi kahineta Saadoqanne Abyataara, “Akxoofeli Abeseloomenne Isra7eele cimata haysa haysa gidi zoris; taanika enta haysa haysa gada zoras. <verse eid="2SA 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16"/>Ha77i Dawitako eeson kiittidi, ‘Bazzon de7iya shaafa gaxan hachi qamma aqopa; hefinthi pinna kicha! Hessi hanonna ixiko, kawoynne iyara de7iya asa ubbay dhayana’ yaagidi odite” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17"/>Yoonataaninne Akimaasi qoncen katamaa gelishin enta asi be7onna mela Aynogeela geetetiya bessan uttidi naagoosona. Issi macca aylliya yada entaw odin, enti bidi kawa Dawitas odoosona. <verse eid="2SA 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18"/>Shin issi panthay enta be7idi Abeseloomes odis. Hessa gisho, enti nam7ay he bessaafe eeson kichidi Biraqima kataman issi addiya soo gakidosona. He addiya soo matan haatha olli de7ees; enti he ollan gelidosona. <verse eid="2SA 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19"/>He addiya machiya oonika eronnaada ollaa doona kammada iya bolla kathi miccasu.<verse eid="2SA 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20"/>Abeseloome aylleti addiya soo yidi machiw, “Akmaasinne Yoonataani awun de7oona?” yaagidi oychidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Machiya, “Enti shaafa pinnidi bidosona” yaagasu. Enti koyin, bentonna ixin, Yerusalaame simmidosona.<verse eid="2SA 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21"/>He asati bidaape guye, nam7u asati ollafe keyidi, kawa Dawitas odanaw bidosona. Dawitako, “Akxoofeli hinte bolla haysa haysa oothana gidi zori wothida gisho eeson dendidi, shaafa pinnite” yaagidosona. <verse eid="2SA 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22"/>Dawitinne iyara de7iya asa ubbay Yordaanose pinnidi bidosona. Sa7i wontiya wode ubbay pinnidi wuridosona.<verse eid="2SA 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23"/>Akxoofeli ba zorey eketiboonaysa erida wode ba hariya kooridi ba de7iya katamaa bis. Akxoofeli ba soo giigisidi suletidi, hayqidi ba aawa duufon moogetis.<verse eid="2SA 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24"/>Abeseloomeynne iyara de7iya asa ubbay Yordaanose pinniya wode Dawiti Mahanayma katamaa gakis. <verse eid="2SA 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25"/>Abeseloomey ba olanchota bolla Iyo7aaba bessan Amasaya shuumis. Amasayi Isra7eele addiya Yotora na7a. Yotori Na7oosa na7iw, Iyo7aaba aayiw Xaruya michiw Abigiya ekis. <verse eid="2SA 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26"/>Isra7eeletinne Abeseloomey Galada biittan dunkaanidosona.<verse eid="2SA 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27"/>Dawiti Mahanayma katamaa gakiya wode Amoone biittan Raabape yida Na7oosa na7ay Shoobi, Lodobaara katamape yida Ami7eela na7ay Makirinne Orogalma katamape yida Galada addey Barziley, <verse eid="2SA 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28"/>hiixiyabata, keretanne shaateta ehidosona. Qassi enti giste, banga, dhiille, shaashshi, qom7olonne misire, <verse eid="2SA 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29"/>eessi, pila, meqa maathinne dorse Dawitinne iya asay maana mela ekidi yidosona. Hessa enti ehiday, “Asay bazzon koshatis, daaburis, saamotis” gidi qopida gishosa.<verse eid="2SA 17:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Abeseloome Hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1"/>Dawiti baara de7iya asaa taybidi shaalaqatanne mato halaqata enta bolla shuumis. <verse eid="2SA 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2"/>Dawiti asa heedzu cugan shaakis; issi cugaa Iyo7aabi, nam7antho cugaa Iyo7aaba ishay, Xaruya na7ay Abisi, heedzantho cugaa Gaate addey Itayi kiittees. Kawoy asaako, “Tuma ta hintera issife baana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3"/>Shin asay, “Neeni baanaw bessenna! Nuuni baqatiyako enti nuna koyokona; hari attoshin nuupe baggay hayqiyakoka nubaa wuda gookona. Shin neeni ne xalaala tammu mukulupe daraasa. Hessa gisho, neeni kataman uttada nuus maado kiittiko lo77o” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4"/>Kawoy, “Hintena lo77iyaba ta oothana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:4">Dawiti dirsa pengiya matan eqidi, asa ubbay xeetaninne mukulan salpidi keyishin be7is. <verse eid="2SA 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5"/>Kawoy Iyo7aaba, Abisanne Itaya, “Ta gisho gidi, he na7atetha addiya Abeseloome qohopite” yaagidi kiittis. Kawoy hessa halaqatas odiya wode olanchoti ubbay si7idosona.<verse eid="2SA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6"/>Dawita olanchoti Isra7eeletara oletanaw Efreema woran salpidosona. <verse eid="2SA 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7"/>He bessan Dawita olanchoti Isra7eele olanchota xoonidosona. He gallas daro asi wuris, laatamu mukulu asi hayqis. <verse eid="2SA 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8"/>Olay gaxare ubbaa gakis; he gallas wori wursida asay mashshi wursida asaape daro.<verse eid="2SA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9"/>Abeseloomey qoponna de7ishe Dawita asaara gahetis. Abeseloomey ba baquluwa toggidashin daashsha wola garsi baquloy gelin, Abeseloome huuphey mithan oyketis. I toggida baquloy iya tohuwa garsafe bin, Abeseloomey carko bolla kaqatidi attis. <verse eid="2SA 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10"/>Asaape issoy hessa be7idi, “Abeseloomey issi wola bolla kaqetidaysa ta be7as” yaagidi Iyo7aabas odis.<verse eid="2SA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11"/>Iyo7aabi baw odida addiya, “Yee, be7as gay? Yaatin ayis iya wodhabikii? Ne hessa oothidaba gidiyako, taani new tammu bira santimenne issi saqe immanashin” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12"/>Addey zaaridi, “Neeni mukulu bira santime ta kushen wothiyakoka taani kawa na7aa bolla ta kushiya denthike! Nuuni ubbay si7ishin, kawoy nena, Abisanne Itaya, ‘Ta gisho gidi, na7atetha Abeseloome qohopite’ yaagidi kiittis. <verse eid="2SA 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13"/>Taani kawa kiitta ixada Abeseloome wodhidaba gidiyako, kawoy ubbaa si7eysada hessa si7anaysi attenna. He wode neeni haaki eqiya asaape issuwa gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14"/>Iyo7aabi, “Taani neera odetashe wode wursike” yaagidi heedzu toora ekidi, Abeseloomey wolaa bolla kaqetidi, paxa de7ishin wozana ayfen caddis. <verse eid="2SA 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15"/>Iyo7aaba ola miishiya tookiya tammu asati Abeseloome yuushuwa teqidi iya shocidi wodhidosona.<verse eid="2SA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16"/>Hessafe guye, Iyo7aabi olaa essanaw moyze punnin asay Isra7eeleta yedetheysa aggis. <verse eid="2SA 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17"/>Enti Abeseloome efidi woran de7iya gita ollan yeggidi, gita shuchu iya bolla dooridosona. He wode Isra7eele asa ubbay ba soo soo baqatis.<verse eid="2SA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18"/>Abeseloomey paxa de7ishe, “Ta sunthan xeegetiya adde na7i taw baawa” yaagidi, bana qofisiya shuchu massida hawulte kawo zangaaran essidi he hawultiya ba sunthan xeegis. Hachi gakanaw he hawultey “Abeseloome hawultiya” geetetees.<verse eid="2SA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Abeseloomes Yeekis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19"/>Hessafe guye, Saadoqa na7aa Akimaasi Iyo7aabako, “Iya morketa kushepe Goday iya ashshida mishiraachuwa sissanaw taani kawako woxa bada odana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20"/>Iyo7aabi, “Akay! Hachi neeni mishiraacho odiya gallas gidenna; hara gallas odanaw danda7aasa. Kawa na7ay hayqida gisho hachi odanaw koshshenna” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21"/>Iyo7aabi Tophe asi gidida issi addiya xeegidi, “Bada, ne be7idaba kawas oda” yaagis. He addey Iyo7aabas gufanni ziggidi woxis.<verse eid="2SA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22"/>Saadoqa na7ay Akimaasi nam7antho Iyo7aabako, “Aybika hano; taani ha Tophe addiya geedo woxana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Iyo7aabi, “Ta na7aw, new woytoy baynaban ayis woxanaw koyay?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23"/>Akimaasi, “Aybika hano; taani woxanaw koyayis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Iyo7aabi, “Yaako woxa” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Akimaasi demba ogiya oykidi woxishe bidi Tophe addiya yeggidi aadhis.<verse eid="2SA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24"/>Dawiti soo pengiyafenne kare pengiyafe giddon uttidashin, naagiya uray keethaa bolla keyidi, issi addey barka woxishe yeysa be7is. <verse eid="2SA 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25"/>Naagiya uray kawa xeegidi odis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Kawoy, “I barka de7iko, mishiraacho ekidi yees” yaagis. Woxiya addey entako matishe yis.<verse eid="2SA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26"/>Naageysi hara woxiya asi be7idi pengiya naagiya addiyako, “Hara asika barka woxishe yees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Kawoy, “Ha addeyka qassi mishiraacho ekidi yees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27"/>Naageysi, “Koyro addiya wothay Saadoqa na7aa Akmaasa wotha taw daanees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Kawoy, “I lo77o asi; I lo77o odara yees” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28"/>Akimaasi kawa xeegidi, “Ubbabay lo77o!” yaagis. Kawa sinthan gufanni ziggidi, “Ta godaa, kawa bolla banta kushiya denthida asata new aathidi immida Goday, ne Xoossay galatetto” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29"/>Kawoy, “Na7atethay, Abeseloomey saro?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Akimaasi, “Iyo7aabi tana kiittana haniya wode wolqaama waaso si7as, shin I aybeko taani erabike” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30"/>Kawoy, “Yaa shiiqa eqa” yaagin I haakidi eqis.<verse eid="2SA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31"/>Hessafe guye, Tophe addey gakidi, “Ta godaw, kawaw, ta new mishiraacho odayis! Ne bolla dendiya ubbaa kushepe Goday hachi nena ashshis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32"/>Kawoy Tophe addiyako, “Na7atetha addey Abeseloomey saro?” yaagidi oychis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Tophe addey, “Ta godaw, kawaw, ne morketinne ne bolla iitabaa oothanaw dendeysati ubbay he na7atetha addiyada hanona” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33"/>Kawoy daro azzanis; pengiyafe qommo baggan de7iya keethaa gelidi yeekis. Kawoy, “Yii, ta na7aw Abeseloome taassa! Ta na7aw taassa! Ne gisho ta hayqarkina! Yii, ta na7aw Abeseloome taassa!” yaagidi yeekis.<verse eid="2SA 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1"/>Kawoy, “Ba na7aa Abeseloomes yeekesinne zeleeles” yaagidi Iyo7aabas odidosona. <verse eid="2SA 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2"/>Kawoy ba na7aas yeekeysa si7ida gisho, he gallas enti ubbay xoonida xoonoy yeehon laametis. <verse eid="2SA 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3"/>Olape baqatidi yeellan guye simmida olanchoda he gallas asay doona pogonna katama gelidosona. <verse eid="2SA 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4"/>Kawoy guuluntidi, ba qaala dhoqu oothidi, “Yii, ta na7aw Abeseloome! Yii, ta na7aw! Abeseloome yii!” yaagidi zeleelis.<verse eid="2SA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5"/>Hessafe guye, Iyo7aabi kawa soo bidi, “Nena, ne adde nayta, ne macca nayta, ne machetanne ne laggethota ashshida ne asa ubbaa hachi neeni kawushadasa. <verse eid="2SA 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6"/>Nena ixeyisata neeni dosaasa; nena doseyisata neeni ixaasa. Ne olanchotinne enta halaqati new aykoka gidonnaysa neeni hachi qoncisadasa. Nuuni ubbay hayqin, Abeseloomey hachi paxa attidaako neeni ufaytanaysa ta be7as. <verse eid="2SA 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7"/>Ha77i denda! Kare keyada ne asaa minthetha. Ta Godaa sunthan caaqayis; neeni keyonna ixiko, hachi qamma neera issi asika attenna. Na7atethafe hachi gakanaw nena gakida iita ubbaafe haysi new aadhida iita gidana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Yerusalaame Simmis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8"/>Hessa gisho, kawoy dendidi pengiya matan uttis. Kawoy pengen uttidaysa asa ubbay si7ida wode kawako yidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">He wode Isra7eele asa ubbay banta soo soo baqatidosona. <verse eid="2SA 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9"/>Isra7eele kochati ubbay issoy issuwara haysada yaagidi palamidosona; “Kawoy Dawiti nuna nu morketa kushepe ashshis; nuna Filisxeemeta kushepe wosisis; shin I ha77i Abeseloome gaason biitta aggidi baqatis. <verse eid="2SA 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10"/>Nu bolla kawotanaada nuuni tiyida Abeseloomey olan hayqis. Yaatin, kawa guye ehanaba hinte ayis si77i gidetii?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11"/>Kawoy Dawiti kahineta Saadoqanne Abyataara kiittidi, Yihuda cimatako haysada yaagis; “Isra7eele asa ubbay odetiya oday kawa gakis. Yaatin, kawa iya gadho zaari ehanaw hinte ayis guye atteetii? <verse eid="2SA 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12"/>Hinte ta ishata; hinte ta ashonne ta suuthu. Yaatin, kawa guye zaari ehanaw hinte ayis haratape guye atteetii?” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13"/>Qassi Dawiti Amaasako, “Neeni ta ashonne ta suuthu gidikii? Hachife doomin, taani nena Iyo7aaba bessan ta tora mocona oothonna ixiko, Xoossi tana pirdo” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14"/>I Yihuda asa ubbaa wozanaa issino oothidi shammis. Hessa gisho, enti kawako kiittidi, “Neera ne asaara ubbay haa simmite” yaagidosona. <verse eid="2SA 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15"/>Kawoy simmidi, Yordaanose shaafa gakanaw yis. Yihuda asay kawa Yordaanose shaafa pinthanaw Galgala bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16"/>Biraqima addey, Biniyaame kochay, Geera na7ay Saami Dawita mokanaw ellesidi Yihuda asaara bis. <verse eid="2SA 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17"/>Iyara Biniyaame koche gidida mukulu asay, Saa7ola aylley Siibi, tammanne ichashu iya naytinne laatamu aylleti iyara de7oosona. Enti kawoy de7iya bessaa Yordaanose shaafa dirgishe bidosona. <verse eid="2SA 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18"/>Kawa soo asaa ehanawunne kawa ufaysiyabaa oothanaw pinniya bessaara pinnidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Geera na7ay Saami Yordaanose shaafa pinnida wode kawa sinthan gufannidi, <verse eid="2SA 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19"/>“Kawaw ta nagaraa taybopa. Ta goday, kawoy, Yerusalaamepe keyiya wode taani ne aylley qohida qohuwa hassayopa. Hesaa ne ulon oykofa. <verse eid="2SA 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20"/>Ne aylley taani nagara oothidaysa erayis; shin ta godaa, kawa mokanaw Yoosefa soo asa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woyko pudeha baggan de7iya Isra7eele zeretha ubbaafe guussu.</char></note> ubbaafe koyrottada taani hachi yas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21"/>Xaruya na7ay Abisi, “Saami Goday tiyida kawa baaddida gisho hayqanaw besseneyee?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22"/>Dawiti Abisako, “Hinteno, Xaruya nayto, hintena gathiyabay aybee? Hinte hachi taw morke gideeti! Hachi Isra7eelen ay asika hayqenna! Hachi Isra7eele kawoy tana!” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23"/>Kawoy Saami, “Ne hayqaka” yaagidi caaqis.<verse eid="2SA 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24"/>Qassi Saa7ola na7ay Mempibostey kawa mokanaw duge wodhis. Kawoy bida gallasape doomidi I saron guye simmiya gallas gakanaw Mempibostey ba tohuwanne ba ma7uwa meeccibeenna; ba buuchaa meedibeenna. <verse eid="2SA 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25"/>Mempibostey kawuwara gahetanaw Yerusalaamepe yida wode kawoy, “Mempiboste, neeni taara ayis babikii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26"/>Mempibostey, “Ta godaw kawaw, taani ne aylley sila gidiya gisho ‘Taani toggada kawuwara baana mela ta hariya koora’ yaagas. Shin ta aylley Siibi tana cimmis. <verse eid="2SA 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27"/>Ta godaa, kawas wordo odidi ta sunthaa iissis. Neeni ta goday, kawoy Xoossa kiitancho mela gidiya gisho nena lo77idaba ootha. <verse eid="2SA 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28"/>Ta aawa soo asa ubbay hayqanaw bessees, shin taani ne aylley ne gaytape meysatara maana mela taw besse immadasa. Yaatin, hessafe aadhiyaba kawa oychanaw taw ay maati de7ii?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29"/>Kawoy zaaridi, “Neeni darobaa odetanaw koshshenna. Neera Siibara gadiya shaaketidi ekana mela kiittas” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30"/>Mempibostey, “Ta goday, kawoy saro soo simmaafe attishin, ubbay Siibas gido” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31"/>Galada addey Barziley kawuwara issife Yordaanose pinnidi iya moyzanaw Roogalimape yis. <verse eid="2SA 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32"/>Barziley laythi hospun tammu gidida cima asi. I daro dure gidiya gisho kawoy Mahanayma kataman de7iya wode kawas koshshiyaba immis. <verse eid="2SA 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33"/>Kawoy iyako, “Neeni taara Yerusalaame yedha; taani new koshshiyaba immana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34"/>Shin Barziley, “Taani hizape daro laythi de7ike; taani kawuwara Yerusalaame ayis boo? <verse eid="2SA 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35"/>Taani ha77i hospun tammu laytha asi; taani iitanne lo77o shaakada eranaw danda7iyana? Taani ne aylley ta miyabaanne uyaaba mal7uwa shaakada eranaw danda7iyana? Taani addenne macca yethi shaakada si7anaw danda7iyana? Yaatin, taani ne aylley, ta godaw kawaw ayis tooho gido? <verse eid="2SA 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36"/>Taani ne aylley nena Yordaanose pinthana. Shin kawoy taw kushe zaaranaw ayis koshshii? <verse eid="2SA 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37"/>Taani ta aawanne ta aaye duufuwa matan ta kataman hayqana mela simmayis. Ne aylley Kimihaami haysish; ta godaa, kawuwara I boo; nena ufaysiyabaa iyaw ootha” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38"/>Kawoy, “Kimihaami taara pinno; nena ufaysiyabaa taani iyaw oothana. Qassi neeni tana oychiyaba ayba gidikoka taani new oothana” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39"/>Hessafe guye, asa ubbay Yordaanose pinnidosona; kawoyka pinnis. Kawoy Barzile yeeridi anjis; Barziley ba soo simmis.<verse eid="2SA 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40"/>Kawoy Yordaanose pinnidi Galgala biya wode Kimihaami iyara issife bis. Yihuda olanchoti ubbaynne Isra7eele olanchotape baggati kawuwara bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41"/>Isra7eele ubbay kawako bidi, “Nu ishati, Yihuda asay kawanne iya soo asaa qosidi, iya asaara issife Yordaanose ayis pinthidona?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 19:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42"/>Yihuda asay, “Nuuni hessa oothiday kawoy nuus mata dabbo gidiya gishosa. Yaatin, hinte hessas ayis yilotetii? Nuuni kawuwape ayko mido? Woyko nuuni iyape ayko ekido?” yaagidosona.<verse eid="2SA 19:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43"/>Isra7eele asay, “Kawuwape tammu kushey nuusa; Dawita matan nuus hintefe aadho maati de7ees! Yaatin, hinte nuna ayis kadhidetii? Kawa guye zaaridi ehanaw koyrottidi odiday nuna gidoko?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Shin Isra7eele asaape Yihuda asay daro wolqanthidi haasayidosona.<verse eid="2SA 19:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Saabe7i Dawita Bolla Dendis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1"/>Biniyaame koche gidida Bikira na7ay Saabe7a geetetiya meto medhiya addey yan de7ees. He addey moyze punnidi, “Nuus Dawitara gishoy baawa! Isseye na7aara nuus laati baawa! Isra7eele asaw, ubbay hinte soo soo gelite!” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2"/>Isra7eele asa ubbay Dawita aggidi, Bikira na7aa Sabe7erara bidosona. Shin Yihuda asay Yordaanosepe Yerusalaame gakanaw aggonna banta kawa kaallidosona.<verse eid="2SA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3"/>Dawiti Yerusalaamen de7iya ba gadho simmida wode, kawo gadho naagana mela ashshida tammu laggethota efidi issi keethan naagisidi wothis. Entaw koshshiyaba immis, shin entara aqibeenna. Enti he keethan naagetidi, hayqana gakanaw am7o gididi de7idosona.<verse eid="2SA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4"/>Kawoy Amaasako, “Yihuda asa ubbaa heedzu gallasan taw xeegada shiisha; neka entara shiiqa” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5"/>Amaasi Yihuda asaa xeeganaw bis; shin kawoy gida gallasan simmanaw danda7ibeenna.<verse eid="2SA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6"/>Dawiti Abisako, “Ha77i Bikira na7aa Saabe7i Abeseloomepe aathidi nuna qohana. Ne godaa olanchota ekada neeni iya geedo kaalla. Hessi hanonna ixiko I gimbetida katamata demmidi nuupe kessi ekana” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7"/>Iyo7aaba asay, kawa naageysatinne mino olanchoti ubbay Abisara Bikira na7aa Saabe7a geedo kaallanaw Yerusalaamepe keyidi bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8"/>Enti bidi Gaba7oonan de7iya wogga zaalla gakiya wode Amaasi entara gahetanaw yis. Iyo7aabi ola ma7uwa ma7i uttis; ba xeessan mashsha dancis. I tangishin iya mashshay shoohuwape kessi ekidi wodhis.<verse eid="2SA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9"/>Iyo7aabi, “Ta ishaw, ne saro de7ay?” yaagidi, Amaasa yeeranaw ba ushacha kushiyan iya buuchaa oykis. <verse eid="2SA 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10"/>Shin Amaasi Iyo7aaba haddirsa kushiyan de7iya mashshaa be7iboona gisho, iyape naagetibeenna. Iyo7aabi iya uluwan caddidi maraaciya biittan zaazis. Amaasi issi cachan hayqida gisho zaari caddibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Iyo7aabinne iya ishaa Abisi Bikira na7aa Saabe7a geedo kaallidosona. <verse eid="2SA 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11"/>Iyo7aaba asaape issoy Amaasa aha matan eqidi, “Iyo7aaba doseynne Dawitaba gidiya oonika Iyo7aaba kaallo” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12"/>Amaasi suuthan iitidi ogiyas giddon kundidi zin7is. Olanchoti ubbay yidi, he bessan eqidaysa he addey be7idi, Amaasa aha ogiyape shooqan goochi kessidi, iya bolla ma7o yeggis. <verse eid="2SA 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13"/>Amaasa ogepe diggidaape guye, Bikira na7aa Saabe7a geedo kaallanaw olanchoti ubbay Iyo7aabara bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14"/>Saabe7i Isra7eele kochata biittara kanthidi, Abeel-Beet-Ma7ika katamaa gakis. Berata biittara kanthishin, asa ubbay shiiqidi iya kaallidosona. <verse eid="2SA 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15"/>Iyo7aabara de7iya asay gakidi, Saabe7i de7iya Abeel-Beet-Ma7ika katama teqidosona. Enti katamaa gimbiyas guye baggara biitta dooridosona. Iyo7aabara de7iya asay gimbiya laallanaw qoxoosona. Enti qoxishin, <verse eid="2SA 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16"/>katamaape issi cinca maccasi enta xeegada, “Si7ite! Si7ite! Bidi, Iyo7aaba xeegite. Taani iyaw odanabay de7ees” yaagasu. <verse eid="2SA 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17"/>I maccaseeko yin, iya, “Neeni Iyo7aabee?” yaagada oychasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Iyo7aabi, “Ee, tana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Maccasiya, “Taani ne aylliya giyaba si7a” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Iyo7aabi, “Taani si7ayis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18"/>Maccasiya, “Beni wode asay, ‘Ne oyshaas Abi7eela katamaa ba’ giiko odi wurees. <verse eid="2SA 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19"/>Isra7eele giddon saronne ammanthiya asi nuna. Isra7eele biittan aayo gidida katamiw neeni dhaysanaw qopaasa. Neeni Godaa laata biitta ayis dhaysanaw koyay?” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20"/>Iyo7aabi, “Hessi taape haako! Katamaa dhaysoy woyko laalethi taape haako! <verse eid="2SA 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21"/>Nu qofay hessa gidenna. Derey dariya Efreema biittan Bikira na7aa Sabe7a geetetiya addey kawa Dawita bolla dendis. He addiya taw immite; taani katamaa yeddada baana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Maccasiya, “Iya huuphiya gimbiya bollara new holana” yaagasu.<verse eid="2SA 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22"/>Hessafe guye, maccasiya ba cinca zoriyara asaako basu. Asay Bikira na7aa Saabe7a qoodhepe qanxidi huuphiya Iyo7aabas holidosona. Yaatin, Iyo7aabi moyze punnin asa ubbay katamaape keyidi, ba soo soo bin, Iyo7aabi kawako Yerusalaame simmis.<verse eid="2SA 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23"/>Iyo7aabi Isra7eele olanchota ubbaa halaqa gidishin, Yoodahe na7ay Banayasi Dawita naageysata halaqa. <verse eid="2SA 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24"/>Adoniraami wolqa ooso ootheyisata halaqa gidishin, Ahiluda na7ay Iyosaafxi hanidaba xaafeysa. <verse eid="2SA 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25"/>Suusi waanna xaafe gidishin, Saadoqinne Abyataari kahine. <verse eid="2SA 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26"/>Qassi Ya7ira addey Irki Dawita kahinetape issuwa.<verse eid="2SA 20:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Gaba7oonata Halo Kessa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1"/>Dawita kawotetha laythan biittay heedzu laythi kumethi koshatis. Hessa gisho, Dawiti Godaa oychin, Goday, “Hessi haniday Saa7olinne iya soo asay Gaba7oona asaa wodhida gisho suuthaa gomey enta gakis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2"/>Yaatin kawoy Gaba7oona asaa xeegidi odisis. Gaba7oona asati Isra7eele zare gidonashin, enti Amoore asaape attidaysata. Isra7eeleti enta ashshanaw entara caaqidosona; shin Saa7oli Isra7eelesinne Yihudas mishetida gisho, enta kumethi dhaysanaw koyis. <verse eid="2SA 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3"/>Dawiti Gaba7oona asaa, “Taani hintew ay ootho? Godaa laata hinte anjana mela taani hintena ay acco?” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4"/>Enti zaaridi, “Nuuni Saa7olape woyko iya soo asaape worqa woyko bira oychoko. Qassi Isra7eele giddofe issi asika wodhanaw nuus maati baawa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Dawiti, “Yaatin, taani hintew ay oothana mela koyeetii?” yaagidi oychis.<verse eid="2SA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5"/>Enti, “Saa7oli nuna dhaysis; nuupe ay asika Isra7eele biittan awunka paxa doonna mela maqetis. <verse eid="2SA 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6"/>Hessa gisho, Saa7ola kochaafe laapun addeta nuus imma. Goday dooridi iya kawothida Saa7ola kataman, Gib7an, Godaa sinthan nuuni enta kaqana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Kawoy, “Taani enta hintew aathada immana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7"/>Saa7ola na7ay Yoonataaninne Dawiti Godaa sinthan caaqida caaquwa gisho, Saa7ola na7aa, Yoonataana na7aa Mempiboste kawoy ashshis. <verse eid="2SA 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8"/>Shin kawoy Dawiti Iyoheela na7iya Raxifa Saa7olas yelida nam7u adde nayta, Armoonanne Mempiboste, qassi Saa7ola na7iya Merooba, Mahoola addiya Barzile na7aa Adir7eelas yelida ichashu adde nayta ekis. <verse eid="2SA 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9"/>Gaba7oona asaas aathidi immin, enti Godaa sinthan zumaa huuphen kaqidosona; laapunay issife hayqidosona. Enti banga caka doomiya wode hayqidosona.<verse eid="2SA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10"/>Iyoheela na7iya Raxifa kayo afila ekada zaalla bolla baw hiixada, kathi cakiya wodiyape bidi ahata bolla iri bukana gakanaw gallas kafoy, qamma do7i bochonaada naagasu.<verse eid="2SA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11"/>Saa7ola laggethiya, Iyoheela na7iya Raxifa oothidaysa Dawiti si7is. <verse eid="2SA 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12"/>Dawiti bidi, Saa7ola meqethaanne iya na7aa Yoonataana meqethaa Galadan de7iya Yaabesa asaape ekis. Filisxeemeti Saa7olanne iya nayta Gilbo7a deriya bolla wodhidi, Beet-Saana gutarape Yaabesa asay kaysotidi ekidosona. <verse eid="2SA 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13"/>Dawiti Saa7ola meqethaanne iya na7aa Yoonataana meqethaa he bessaafe ehis. Qassi kaqetida laapun asata meqethaaka shiishis. <verse eid="2SA 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14"/>Saa7ola meqethaanne iya na7aa Yoonataana meqethaa Biniyaame biittan Xela kataman iya aawa Qiisa duufuwan moogidosona. Kawoy kiittidaba ubbaa enti polidosona. Hessafe guye, enti he biitta gisho woossida woosa Xoossay si7is.<verse eid="2SA 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filisxeemetara Oletida Ola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 20:4-8">1 Taari 20:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15"/>Filisxeemeta giddoninne Isra7eele asaa giddon zaaridi oli dendin, Dawiti ba asaara bis. Filisxeemetara oletidi Dawiti daaburis. <verse eid="2SA 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16"/>Rafaya yaraape Yishibibinooba geetetiya addey de7ees. Naase biratape oosetida, I oykiya tooray heedzu kilo giraamenne bagga; I ooratha mashshi dancidi, Dawita wodhanaw qopidi de7ees. <verse eid="2SA 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17"/>Shin Xaruya na7ay Abisi Dawita ashshis; I Filisxeeme addiya wodhis. Hessafe guye, Dawita asay, “Isra7eele xompey to7onnaada neeni zaarada nuura olaa baaka” yaagidi caaqidosona.<verse eid="2SA 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18"/>Gooba geetetiya bessan Filisxeemetara hara oli dendis. He wode Kusata addey Sabaki, Raafa yara gidida Saafa geetetiya uraa wodhis. <verse eid="2SA 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19"/>Qassika he bessan Filisxeemetara hara oli dendin, Beetelemepe yida Ya7ira na7aa, Elhanaani, toora toomay wandaraashe mela gidida Gaate addiya Gooliyada wodhis.<verse eid="2SA 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20"/>Qassika Gaaten hara oli dendis. He bessan issi adussa addey de7ees. He addiyas issi issi kushiyaninne issi issi tohuwan usupun, woli bolla laatamanne oyddu biradheti de7oosona. Ika Raafa yaraape gidida asi. <verse eid="2SA 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21"/>He addey Isra7eele bushayida wode Dawita ishaa Saama na7ay Yoonataani iya wodhis.<verse eid="2SA 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22"/>Ha oyddati Gaaten de7iya Raafa yarata. Enta Dawitinne iya asay wodhidosona.<verse eid="2SA 21:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Xoono Mazmure</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 18:1-50">Maz 18:1-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1"/>Goday Saa7ola kushepenne iya morketa ubbaa kushepe ashshida gallas Dawiti Godaas ha mazmuriya yexis.<verse eid="2SA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2"/>Goday ta zaalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">taw miixaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:2">I tana ashsheysa.<verse eid="2SA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3"/>Ta Xoossay taani baqatada attiya zaalla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">I ta gondalliya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">I ta atotetha wolqaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:3">I taani baqatada attiya bessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:3">ne tana makallanchota kushepe ashshaasa.<verse eid="2SA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4"/>Galati bessiya Godaa taani xeegana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:4">taani ta morketape attana.<verse eid="2SA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5"/>Hayqo zuley tana teqis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:5">dhayo di7oy tana daganthis.<verse eid="2SA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6"/>Si7oole wodoroy tana qachana hanees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:6">hayqoy xiheda tana oykis.<verse eid="2SA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7"/>Tana metoy un7ethin Godaa xeegas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">tana maaddana mela ta Xoossaako waassas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:7">I ba keethan ta qaala si7is;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:7">ta waassida waasoy iya haythan wodhis.<verse eid="2SA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8"/>Xoossay hanqetida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">biitti qaaxis; buqetis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:8">salota xaphoy kokoris; qaaxis<verse eid="2SA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9"/>Iya siidhiyape cuyay keyis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">iya doonape tama lacoynne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:9">xuuggiya bonqoy keyis.<verse eid="2SA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10"/>Saluwa phalqidi duge wodhis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:10">iya tohuwape garsara sakana dhumi de7ees.<verse eid="2SA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11"/>Kiruubetan uttidi paallis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:11">carko qefiya bolla uttidi bis.<verse eid="2SA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12"/>Bana dhuman teqis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:12">iya dunkaaney irara siketida shaara.<verse eid="2SA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13"/>Iya sinthan de7iya poo7uwape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:13">tama bonqoy keyees.<verse eid="2SA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14"/>Goday salope guummis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:14">Ubbaafe dhoqa Xoossay ba qaala sissis.<verse eid="2SA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15"/>Ba dongiya dukidi, ba morketa laallis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:15">wol7antha poo7o kiittidi, enta yedethis.<verse eid="2SA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16"/>Goday seerida wodenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">hanqetidi peenuqida wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:16">abba giddon biittay bentis;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:16">Sa7aa baasoyka qoncis.<verse eid="2SA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17"/>Goday bollafe kushe yeddidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">tana oykis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:17">ciimmo haathaafe tana kessis.<verse eid="2SA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18"/>I tana ta wolqaama morketape,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:18">ta wolqaafe bolla gidida tana ixeysatape ashshis.<verse eid="2SA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19"/>Ta metuwa gallas enti ta bolla dendidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:19">shin Goday tana zempiseysa.<verse eid="2SA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20"/>I tana dalga bessi kessis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:20">tanan ufaytida gisho tana ashshis.<verse eid="2SA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21"/>Ta xillotethaada Goday taw qanxis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:21">ta kushe geeshshatethaada taw zaaris.<verse eid="2SA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22"/>Ayis giiko taani Godaa ogiya kaallas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:22">qassi ta Xoossaa aggada iita oothabike.<verse eid="2SA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23"/>Taani iya higgiya ubbaa naagas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:23">iya wogaa polanaysa aggabike.<verse eid="2SA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24"/>Taani iya sinthan suure de7as;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:24">tana nagarape naagas.<verse eid="2SA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25"/>Goday taw ta xillotethaadanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:25">ta geeshshatethaada zaaris.<verse eid="2SA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26"/>Neeni keehatas keeha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:26">suuretas neeni suure.<verse eid="2SA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27"/>Geeshshatas neeni geeshshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:27">shin geellatas neeni morke.<verse eid="2SA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28"/>Bantana kawusheyisata ashshaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:28">shin otoranchota kawushaasa.<verse eid="2SA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29"/>Abeeti Godaw, ta xompey nena;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:29">Goday ta dhumaa poo7isis.<verse eid="2SA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30"/>Ne maaduwan ta morketa yedhada baana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:30">ta Xoossan gimbe dirsa gupa aadhana.<verse eid="2SA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31"/>Xoossaa ogey suure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">Godaa qaalay geeshshi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:31">iyako baqatiya ubbaas I gondalle.<verse eid="2SA 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32"/>Goday attishin, hara xoossi oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:32">Nu Xoossay attishin, hara zaalli oonee?<verse eid="2SA 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33"/>Xoossay taw mino miixaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:33">I ta ogiya polo oothees.<verse eid="2SA 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34"/>I ta tohuwa gen7e tohoda minthees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:34">tana dhoqa bessan minthidi essees.<verse eid="2SA 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35"/>I ta kushiya olas loohisees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:35">ta qesey naase birata donge dukees.<verse eid="2SA 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36"/>Tana ashshiya ne gondalliya taw immadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:36">ne katisoy tana gitayees.<verse eid="2SA 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37"/>Ta hemethaa dalgisaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:37">ta gaadiya minthaasa.<verse eid="2SA 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38"/>Ta morketa yedethada mentherethas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:38">enti dhayonna de7ishin guye simmike.<verse eid="2SA 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39"/>Enti zaaridi dendonna mela shocas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:39">ta tohuwape garsan kundidosona.<verse eid="2SA 22:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40"/>Olas taw wolqa dancisadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:40">ta morketa taw gulbatisadasa.<verse eid="2SA 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41"/>Ta morketa ta sinthafe baqatisadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:41">tana ixeyisata dhaysas.<verse eid="2SA 22:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42"/>Maade koyidi waassidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">shin oonika enta ashshibeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 22:42">Godaa enti xeegidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:42">shin I entaw koybeenna.<verse eid="2SA 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43"/>Taani enta baanada liiqisas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:43">oge urqada enta yedhas.<verse eid="2SA 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44"/>Makalla ta asaape tana ashshadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">kawotethata bolla tana shuumadasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:44">ta eronna asay taw haaretis.<verse eid="2SA 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45"/>Allaga derey tana aaddashees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:45">ta woriya si7idi taw kiitetoosona.<verse eid="2SA 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46"/>Enti wolqa dhayidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:46">banta miixape kokorishe keyidi yoosona.<verse eid="2SA 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47"/>Goday de7on de7ees! Ta zaallay anjeto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:47">Tana ashshiya zaallay dhoqu dhoqu go.<verse eid="2SA 22:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48"/>I ta haluwa keyiya Xoossaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:48">kawotethata taape garsan haarisees.<verse eid="2SA 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49"/>Ta morketape tana ashshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">ta morketa bolla tana dhoqu dhoqu oothaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:49">Oda medhiya asape tana ashshaasa.<verse eid="2SA 22:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50"/>Abeeti Godaw taani kawotethata giddon nena galatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:50">ne sunthaa yexana.<verse eid="2SA 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51"/>Xoossay ba kawas gita xoono immees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">ba tiyida Dawitasinne iya kochaas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 22:51">merinaa siiquwa bessees.<verse eid="2SA 22:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawita Wursetha Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1"/>Haysi Dawiti wursetha haasaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:1">Isseye na7aa Dawita wuresethay haysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">I Yayqooba Xoossan tiyetidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Xoossay iya dhoqu dhoqu oothidaysa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:1">Isra7eelen lo77o mazmure yexeysa.<verse eid="2SA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2"/>“Godaa Ayyaanay ta baggara odees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:2">iya qaalay ta inxarsan de7ees.<verse eid="2SA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3"/>Isra7eele Xoossay taw odis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Isra7eele Zaallay haysada yaagis.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Xillotethan haariya kawoy,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:3">Xoossa yashshan aysiya kawoy,<verse eid="2SA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4"/>I shaari bayna guura doliya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">xalqe poo7o mela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:4">I iri bukidi aadhin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:4">biittafe maata dolisiya booqalsa mela.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5"/>Tuma ta keetha asay Xoossa sinthan suure;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">I taara merinaw caaqis;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">ha caaqoy giigidi, minnidinne naagetidi de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2SA 23:5">Xoossay taw xoono immana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:5">ta amotidaba ubbaa I tuma polana.<verse eid="2SA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6"/>Shin iita asati ubbay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:6">kushen shiishanaw hanonna agunthada wora holetana.<verse eid="2SA 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7"/>Agunthu bochiya oonika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">wale woyko xam7a ba kushen oykanaw koshshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2SA 23:7">hessi ba de7iya bessan eexana” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawitara De7iya Mino Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 11:10-41">1 Taari 11:10-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8"/>Mino Dawita asata sunthay haysafe kaallidi de7eyisata. Koyroy, Takmoona yeleta gidida Yoseeb-Bestibeete geetetees; I heedzata halaqa; issi toho olan ba tooran hospun xeetu asi wodhis.<verse eid="2SA 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9"/>Heedzatape issoy, iya kaalliya nam7anthoy, Ahoha sheeshi gidida Dodo na7aa Alaazara. Issi gallas inne Dawiti olas shiiqida Filisxeemeta mandidosona; Isra7eele asay guye simmis. <verse eid="2SA 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10"/>Shin I ba bessan minni eqidi, iya kushey argaacidi mashshaara oyketana gakanaw Filisxeemeta shocis. He gallas Goday gita xoono immis. Olay eqin, olanchoti Alaazarako simmidi yidosona; shin enti hayqida Filisxeemetape ola ma7o qaaridosonape attishin, haraba oothibookona.<verse eid="2SA 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11"/>Iyape kaalley qassi Arooda yeleta gidida Aga na7aa Saama. Issi gallas Filisxeemeti misirey kumida shooqan, Leehi geetetiya bessan shiiqin, Isra7eeleti enta sinthafe baqatidosona. <verse eid="2SA 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12"/>Shin Saami shooqa giddon murti eqidi oletis. Filisxeemeta wodhis; he gallas Goday wolqaama xoono immis.<verse eid="2SA 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13"/>Katha caka wode hastamu mino asatape heedzati Adulaama gongoluwa Dawitako bidosona. He wode Filisxeeme olanchoti Raafayme zangaaran dunkaanidosona. <verse eid="2SA 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14"/>He wode Dawiti miixan de7ees; Filisxeeme olanchota cugay qassi Beetelemen olla kambe de7ees. <verse eid="2SA 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15"/>Dawiti haathe uyanaw amotidi, “Beeteleme katamaa pengiya matan de7iya olape haathe tana oone ushshanay” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16"/>Ha heedzu mino asati Filisxeeme olanchota gutaa kanthidi, Beeteleme katama pengen de7iya ollafe haathe duuqidi Dawitas ehidosona. Shin I uyonna ixidi, Godaa sinthan tigidi, <verse eid="2SA 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17"/>“Abeeti Godaw, haysa uyanaysi taape haako! Ha haatha banta shempuwa bayzidi ehida asata suuthu gidennee?” yaagidi uyonna ixis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Ha heedzu mino asati haysa oothidosona.<verse eid="2SA 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18"/>Xaruya na7aa Iyo7aaba ishay Abisi hastamata halaqa; I heedzu xeetu asata ba tooran olidi wodhis; ika heedzatada eretis. <verse eid="2SA 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19"/>I hastamatape aadhidi bonchetida asi; I heedzata mela eretida asi gidonna ixikoka hastamatas halaqa.<verse eid="2SA 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20"/>Qabxi7eela yeleta gidida Yoodahe na7ay Banayasi mino ooso oothida gita asi. I nam7u eretida Moo7abe asata wodhis. Issi wode shachi wodhiya gallas ollan wodhidi gaammo wodhis. <verse eid="2SA 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21"/>Qassi issi gita Gibxe addiya wodhis; Gibxe addey toora oykis; shin I xam7a oykidi iyako bidi, iya kushepe toora dafi ekidi, iya toorara iya wodhis. <verse eid="2SA 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22"/>Yoodahe na7ay Banayasi haysa oothis; iya sunthay heedzataysada eretis. <verse eid="2SA 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23"/>I hastamata giddon daro bonchetida asi, shin I heedzata taybuwan deenna. Dawiti iya bana naagiya wotaadaretas tora mocona oothis.<verse eid="2SA 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24"/>He hastamata giddon de7eysati, Iyo7aaba ishaa Asaheela, Beeteleme yeleta gidida Dooda na7aa Eliyaana, <verse eid="2SA 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25"/>Arooda yeleta gidida Saamanne Eliqa, <verse eid="2SA 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26"/>Falxa yara gidida Selesa, Taqoha addiya Esika na7aa Irasa, <verse eid="2SA 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27"/>Anatoote yeleta gidida Abi7ezera, Kuussa yeleta gidida Mabunaya, <verse eid="2SA 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28"/>Ahoha yara gidida Xalmoona, <verse eid="2SA 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29"/>Naxoofa yeleta gidida Mahirayanne Ba7ana na7aa Heleba. Biniyaame biittan, Gib7a yeleta gidida Ribaaya na7aa Itaya, <verse eid="2SA 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30"/>Phir7atoona yeleta gidida Banaya, Ga7aasa zangaara matape yida Hidaya, <verse eid="2SA 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31"/>Araba yeleta gidida Abalboona, Barhuuma addiya Azmoota, <verse eid="2SA 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32"/>Sha7alboona yeleta gidida Eliyaaba, Asana nayta, Yoonataana, <verse eid="2SA 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33"/>Arooda yeleta gidida Saamanne Shaara na7aa Ahi7aama, <verse eid="2SA 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34"/>Ma7ika yeleta gidida Ahasbaya na7aa Elfalaxa, Gilo yeleta gidida Akxoofela na7aa Eli7aama, <verse eid="2SA 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35"/>Qarmeloosa yeleta gidida Hexira, Araba yeleta gidida Pa7aara, <verse eid="2SA 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36"/>Suubba yeleta gidida Naatana na7aa Yigi7aala, Gaade yeleta gidida Baana, <verse eid="2SA 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37"/>Amoone yeleta gidida Seleqa, Xaruya na7aa Iyo7aaba ola miishiya tookiya Ba7eroota yeleta gidida Nahiraya, <verse eid="2SA 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38"/>Yatira yara gidiya Irayanne Gareeba, <verse eid="2SA 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39"/>Hite addiya Ooriyoona. Enti kumethi hastamanne laapuna.<verse eid="2SA 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Asaa Taybis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 21:1-27">1 Taari 21:1-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1"/>Godaa hanqoy qassika Isra7eele bolla eexis; Goday Dawita enta bolla denthethidi, “Bada Isra7eelenne Yihuda asaa tayba” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2"/>Hessa gisho, kawoy tora moconata Iyo7aabanne baara de7eysatako haysada yaagis; “Isra7eele kochata Daanepe Barsaabe gakanaw taani erana mela Isra7eele asaa bidi taybite” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3"/>Shin Iyo7aabi, “Goday ne Xoossay ha de7iya asaa bolla xeetu kushe gujo! Hessa ta godaa, kawa ayfey be7o! Shin ta goday, kawoy ayis hessa melaba oothanaw koyii?” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4"/>Shin kawa qaalay Iyo7aabanne tora moconata xoonin, enti kawa sinthafe keyidi, Isra7eele asaa taybanaw bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5"/>Enti Yordaanose pinnidi dugeha baggan de7iya, zangaara giddon de7iya Aro7eera kataman dunkaanidosona; yaape Gaade kanthidi Iyazeera gakidosona. <verse eid="2SA 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6"/>Yaape enti Galadanne Hiteta biittan de7iya Qaadesa bidosona; yaape qassi Daane bidosona; yaara Sidoona gakidosona. <verse eid="2SA 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7"/>Yaape dendidi, Xiroosa miixanne Hiwetanne Kanaaneta katamaa ubbaa bidosona. Wursethan Yihuda Negeban de7iya Barsaabe bidosona.<verse eid="2SA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8"/>Enti biitta ubbaa yuuyishe uddufun ageenanne laatamu gallas gam7idi, Yerusalaame simmidosona.<verse eid="2SA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9"/>Iyo7aabi asaa taybuwa kawa erisis; Isra7eelen mashshan oletanaw danda7iya hospun xeetu mukulu mino olanchoti, Yihudan qassi ichashu xeetu mukulu olanchoti de7oosona.<verse eid="2SA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10"/>Asaa taybidaape guye, Dawita wozanay hirgin, Dawiti, “Taani ha oosuwan gita nagara oothas. Shin ha77i abeeti Godaw, taani nena woossayis; ta nagaraa, ne aylliya nagaraa atto ga. Taani daro boozaba hanas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11"/>Wontetha gallas Dawiti hiixape dendiya wode Dawitas qoncethi be7iya, nabiya Gaadeko Godaa qaalay yis. <verse eid="2SA 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12"/>“Bada, Dawitako, ‘Taani nena heedzubaape issuwa doorana mela bessayis; taani ne bolla polanaw entafe issuwa doora’ yaagees Goday” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13"/>Gaadi Dawitako bidi, “Heedzu laythi ne biitta bolla kosha ehoyee? Woyko ne morketi nena yedethin, heedzu ageena enta sinthafe baqataneyee? Woyko ne biitta bolla heedzu gallas gadoy yaanaysa dooray? Ane ha77i qopada taani tana kiittidaysas zaaranaba oda” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14"/>Dawiti Gaadeko, “Taani daro un7etas. Godaa maarotay gita gidiya gisho, nuuni iya kushen kundana; tana asa kushen yeggofo” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15"/>Hessa gisho, wontafe bidi I gida gallasay gakanaw Goday Isra7eele biittan gado kiittis. Isra7eele biittan Daanepe bidi Barsaabe gakanaw laapun tammu mukulu asi hayqis. <verse eid="2SA 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16"/>Yerusalaame dhaysanaw kiitanchoy ba kushiya miccida wode asaa bolla gakida gadoy Godaa azzanthida gisho, asaa shociya kiitanchuwako, “Gidana! Ne kushiya zara” yaagis. Godaa kiitanchoy he wode Yaabuse addiya Orna wudumman de7ees.<verse eid="2SA 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17"/>Asaa shociya kiitanchuwa Dawiti be7ida wode Godaako, “Nagaraa oothiday tana; ta balas! Ha dorsati ay oothidona? Hayyana, tananne ta aawa soo asaa ne seerana mela taani woossayis” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawiti Yarsho Bessi Giigisis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18"/>He gallas Gaadi Dawitako yidi, “Bada, Yaabuse addiya Orna wudumman Godaas yarsho bessi giigisa” yaagis. <verse eid="2SA 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19"/>Dawiti, Goday Gaade baggara kiittidaysada oothanaw pude bis. <verse eid="2SA 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20"/>Orni duge xeelliya wode, kawoynne iya asati baako yeysa be7is. I gaxa keyidi, gufannidi kawas ziggis.<verse eid="2SA 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21"/>Orni, “Ta goday kawoy ba aylliyako, ayis yidee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Dawiti, “Asaa bollafe gadoy simmana mela taani Godaas yarsho bessi giigisanaw ne wudumma shammanaw yas” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22"/>Orni, “Ta goday, kawoy ba koydaba ekidi yarsho! Xuussa yarshos boorati de7oosona; eeso mithas qassi kathi bukiya miisheynne boora qambari de7ees. <verse eid="2SA 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23"/>Kawaw, haysa ubbaa Orni kawas immis” yaagis. Gujidi Orni, “Goday ne Xoossay ne yarshuwa eko” yaagis.<verse eid="2SA 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24"/>Shin kawoy, “Akay, taani ta miishen shammana. Ta Godaa, Xoossaas xuussa yarsho gatey bayna yarshike” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Hessa gisho, kawoy wudummaanne boorata Ornafe ishatamu bira santimen shammis. <verse eid="2SA 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25"/>Dawiti he bessan yarsho bessi giigisidi xuussa yarshonne issifetetha yarsho Godaas yarshis. Goday biitta gisho woosetida woosa si7idi, gaduwa Isra7eelepe diggis.<verse eid="2SA 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24"/>
</usx>
